{"id": "47", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface such as a bed or table.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n5. Finally, fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is also on the bias.", "pred": "These steps will help you fold the quilt neatly and efficiently.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\n\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface, such as a bed, table, or other flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner of the quilt up toward the center, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner of the quilt up toward the center, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner of the quilt down toward the center, again making sure the fold is on the bias.\n5. Finally, fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n\nThese steps will help you fold the quilt neatly and efficiently.", "cot": "[\"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface, such as a bed, table, or other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner of the quilt up toward the center, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner of the quilt up toward the center, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner of the quilt down toward the center, again making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Finally, fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nThese steps will help you fold the quilt neatly and efficiently.\", \"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, again ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nAnswer: Fold the lower right, lower left, top left, and top right corners of the quilt up or down toward the center, making sure each fold is on the bias.\", \"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface such as a bed, table, or any other suitable surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner of the quilt up toward the center, ensuring that the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner of the quilt up toward the center, also ensuring that the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner of the quilt down toward the center, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, again ensuring that the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can neatly fold a quilt.\", \"Answer: To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, again ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\"]", "time_sec": 18.394, "generation_time_seconds": 18.3884, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 