{"id": "65", "question": "what is the proper way to dispose of a worn usa flag", "gt": "The proper way to dispose of a worn US flag is to burn it in a proper ceremony. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold before being burned.", "pred": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag, as described in the passages, involves burning the flag in a proper ceremony. This ceremony includes folding the flag in the customary triangle fold.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag, as described in the passages, involves burning the flag in a proper ceremony. This ceremony includes folding the flag in the customary triangle fold.", "cot": "[\"The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag, as described in the passages, involves burning the flag in a proper ceremony. This ceremony includes folding the flag in the customary triangle fold.\", \"The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag, as described in the given passages, involves burning the flag yourself in a proper ceremony. This process includes folding the flag in the customary triangle fold before burning.\", \"To dispose of a worn USA flag, the proper way involves burning the flag in a proper ceremony. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold before burning.\", \"The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag, as outlined in the passages, is to burn the flag yourself in a proper ceremony. This includes folding the flag in the customary triangle fold.\"]", "time_sec": 8.241, "generation_time_seconds": 8.2388, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 6169, 1616, 311, 27390, 315, 264, 23704, 7279, 5181, 11, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 17601, 19675, 279, 5181, 304, 264, 6169, 21536, 13, 1096, 21536, 5646, 44742, 279, 5181, 304, 279, 72248, 21495, 11555, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.691, -0.0297, -0.0003, -0.0, 