oists to the appropriate lengths. Assemble the floor and place it on the skids, ensuring it is square. Anchor the frame to the skids with joist clip angles. For the walls, they are constructed separately and then raised onto the frame. The dimensions of the shed can be easily expanded in increments of 2 or 4 feet."}, {"rollout": 3, "token_ids": [1249, 1936, 264, 15651, 4686, 24354, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 50590, 279, 12911, 66963, 5145, 553, 20045, 279, 2747, 448, 264, 220, 19, 24241, 6193, 315, 16830, 291, 41523, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 37666, 323, 2573, 4818, 3365, 66963, 19649, 1378, 220, 19, 87, 19, 1901, 3365, 311, 264, 3084, 315, 220, 21, 7541, 1817, 13, 2573, 323, 2188, 1493, 1901, 3365, 4092, 311, 279, 24354, 4752, 6649, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 37666, 323, 1634, 15790, 10946, 1671, 66963, 19649, 1378, 220, 17, 87, 21, 30130, 7647, 1671, 311, 264, 3084, 315, 220, 22, 220, 18, 14, 19, 7541, 323, 4743, 7647, 1671, 311, 264, 3084, 315, 220, 19, 19, 220, 18, 14, 19, 7541, 13, 1634, 15790, 279, 6422, 323, 1992, 432, 389, 279, 1901, 3365, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 6422, 57949, 3772, 315, 279, 15651, 4686, 24354, 6649, 13, 29279, 279, 4034, 374, 9334, 323, 9767, 432, 311, 279, 1901, 3365, 448, 3040, 7647, 380, 12327, 25941, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 30485, 77958, 66963, 12380, 279, 4034, 389, 279, 1901, 3365, 323, 99034, 604, 279, 6422, 7647, 1671, 311, 279, 1901, 3365, 13, 48384, 220, 18, 14, 19, 24241, 24459, 9777, 2371, 299, 994, 87898, 36148, 8630, 279, 4034, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 28468, 71178, 33099, 2652, 66963, 576, 14285, 369, 279, 24354, 525, 5798, 25156, 323, 1221, 9226, 8630, 279, 4034, 382, 21, 13, 3070, 38946, 32023, 66963, 576, 24354, 6839, 374, 220, 21, 7541, 1293, 553, 220, 19, 7541, 6884, 13, 1446, 646, 6707, 9225, 1181, 15336, 304, 61600, 315, 220, 17, 476, 220, 19, 7541, 553, 2701, 4428, 57949, 7354, 382, 1359, 2701, 1493, 11682, 7354, 11, 498, 646, 9245, 264, 44552, 323, 1632, 12, 3497, 3018, 15651, 4686, 24354, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.7643, -0.02