oft-foam bristles to clean the inside of the glass. After rinsing thoroughly with hot water, dry the wine glasses with a smooth lint-free cloth, such as a microfiber or flour sack towel. It's important to clean the glasses by hand to avoid chips and spots. Lay a towel in the sink before filling with hot water and wash one wine glass at a time to avoid damage. Use a small amount of detergent and use it only where it's needed -- in the bottom of the glass and around the rim. Cradle the bowl of the glass in one hand while washing to protect the stem."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1249, 11369, 13078, 28147, 10277, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 2314, 5985, 95518, 576, 61744, 1714, 374, 311, 11369, 13078, 28147, 553, 1424, 13, 43924, 264, 42613, 304, 279, 19309, 1573, 21274, 432, 448, 4017, 3015, 13, 5985, 825, 8991, 518, 264, 882, 311, 5648, 5557, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 10253, 422, 1404, 15772, 95518, 5443, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 90134, 1172, 1380, 432, 594, 4362, 1959, 304, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 8991, 323, 2163, 279, 30130, 13, 1096, 8609, 5358, 279, 26785, 504, 27887, 279, 12656, 315, 697, 1790, 8991, 315, 13078, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 61547, 279, 80848, 95518, 4553, 71355, 279, 19212, 315, 279, 8991, 304, 825, 1424, 1393, 27686, 311, 6016, 279, 19101, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 29019, 25704, 95518, 715, 256, 481, 1416, 4017, 3015, 323, 23034, 90134, 1513, 944, 975, 11, 990, 27815, 38862, 311, 4057, 51396, 13078, 48132, 13, 51032, 3948, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 38862, 448, 4017, 3015, 11, 1077, 432, 2498, 304, 279, 8991, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 11, 323, 279, 38862, 686, 72639, 894, 32147, 13078, 34951, 287, 311, 279, 8991, 624, 256, 481, 1752, 279, 4766, 315, 279, 8991, 11, 990, 264, 19101, 1664, 15625, 448, 8413, 12, 824, 309, 1411, 65943, 624, 256, 481, 4636, 96039, 287, 26364, 448, 4017, 3015, 11, 9058, 279, 13078, 28147, 448, 264, 10876, 57920, 12577, 27292, 11, 1741, 438, 264, 8003, 82945, 476, 19828, 52333, 42613, 624, 256, 481, 12580, 748, 11552, 25, 3731, 13078, 646, 52