e vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1249, 4240, 264, 46622, 10378, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 95210, 279, 46622, 10378, 3421, 389, 279, 4889, 315, 697, 3753, 624, 17, 13, 10783, 279, 3421, 26, 279, 10378, 44239, 1265, 14983, 1290, 700, 421, 432, 4436, 944, 4937, 6758, 476, 19046, 311, 279, 2114, 594, 27263, 624, 18, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 4766, 279, 14178, 624, 19, 13, 10783, 279, 10378, 504, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 553, 6975, 837, 23593, 279, 10378, 41904, 323, 33832, 279, 10378, 700, 315, 279, 45711, 34731, 10284, 624, 20, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 279, 10378, 438, 1632, 438, 279, 14178, 304, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 624, 21, 13, 1032, 6459, 279, 10378, 323, 3271, 279, 46622, 1182, 2348, 279, 7002, 382, 49574, 11, 1393, 15826, 279, 80207, 11, 498, 1231, 1083, 1366, 311, 4057, 279, 5622, 4065, 6945, 315, 279, 46622, 323, 4240, 1052, 1083, 13, 11471, 6529, 311, 279, 3082, 2163, 279, 57920, 4051, 11, 2238, 13, 3216, 17592, 279, 57920, 4051, 4034, 11, 8661, 2615, 311, 57920, 33651, 646, 387, 18163, 11, 323, 264, 9283, 81881, 646, 387, 42478, 304, 369, 264, 803, 17423, 15826, 13, 1084, 686, 1083, 1492, 697, 46622, 1598, 438, 29720, 438, 432, 646, 382, 16141, 25, 2014, 4240, 264, 46622, 10378, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 25, 95210, 279, 46622, 10378, 3421, 11, 4057, 279, 3421, 11, 4057, 57920, 504, 4766, 279, 14178, 323, 279, 10378, 11, 28969, 323, 4240, 279, 10378, 11, 50036, 279, 10378, 11, 323, 3271, 279, 46622, 1182, 2348, 279, 7002, 13, 22406, 11, 4057, 279, 5622, 4065, 6945, 315, 279, 46622, 323, 4240, 2163, 279, 57920, 4051, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.2991, -0.0, -0.7078, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0035, -0.0765, -0.0005, -0.0058, -0.1394, -0.008, -0.0, -0.3155, -0.0083, -0.0004, 