{"id": "412", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you must first obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island. This will turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg. After hatching them, buy the breeding structure. Then, use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster. The order of the monsters does not matter.", "pred": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monster into an egg by hatching it.\n3. Buy the breeding structure for the Shugabush Island.\n4. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster.\n\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monster into an egg by hatching it.\n3. Buy the breeding structure for the Shugabush Island.\n4. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster.\n\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.", "cot": "[\"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monster into an egg by hatching it.\\n3. Buy the breeding structure for the Shugabush Island.\\n4. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster.\\n\\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn the Shugabush Monsters into eggs.\\n3. Hatch the eggs.\\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\\n5. Breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\\n\\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into eggs by hatching them.\\n3. Purchase the breeding structure.\\n4. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\\n\\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter, and the breeding combination is crucial for obtaining the desired Shugabeats.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\\n3. Hatch the egg.\\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\\n5. Breed the Shugabush and Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\\n\\nIt's important to note that the breeding process is not guaranteed to produce a Shugabeats, so keep on trying until you get the desired result.\"]", "time_sec": 19.5, "generation_time_seconds": 19.4964, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 63424, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 624, 17, 13, 11999, 697, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 1119, 458, 18636, 553, 305, 31924, 432, 624, 18, 13, 11292, 279, 39208, 5944, 369, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 10720, 624, 19, 13, 5443, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 323, 279, 49840, 38630, 304, 279, 39208, 5944, 311, 633, 279, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 17651, 382, 2132, 594, 2989, 311, 5185, 429, 3