{"id": "467", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Hiking as a hobby has numerous benefits for both the body and the mind. It is an inexpensive and accessible activity that can be enjoyed by individuals of all fitness levels. Hiking allows people to explore and discover beautiful natural areas, promoting a deeper connection with the environment. It also has positive effects on mental health, reducing stress and anxiety. Additionally, hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can improve overall fitness and reduce the risk of heart disease. Exposure to sunshine during hiking can also increase vitamin D levels in the body. Overall, hiking offers a wide range of benefits for individuals seeking physical and mental well-being.", "pred": "The benefits of hiking as a hobby include promoting mental health, offering cardiovascular benefits, and combating stress and anxiety symptoms.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The benefits of hiking as a hobby include promoting mental health, offering cardiovascular benefits, and combating stress and anxiety symptoms.", "cot": "[\"The benefits of hiking as a hobby include promoting mental health, offering cardiovascular benefits, and combating stress and anxiety symptoms.\", \"Step 1: Identify the key benefits of hiking from the passage.\\n- Hiking promotes mental health.\\n- Hiking is a cardiovascular activity, which benefits the cardiovascular system.\\n- Hiking has a positive impact on combating stress and anxiety.\\n\\nStep 2: Summarize the benefits.\\n- Hiking is beneficial for mental health.\\n- Hiking is good for the cardiovascular system.\\n- Hiking helps combat stress and anxiety.\\n\\nAnswer: Hiking is beneficial for mental health, promotes cardiovascular health, and helps combat stress and anxiety.\", \"Step 1: Identify the benefits of hiking mentioned in the passages.\\n- Promotes mental health\\n- Increases levels of vitamin D\\n- Benefits cardiovascular system\\n- Reduces the chances of heart disease\\n- Increases overall fitness\\n- Combats symptoms of stress and anxiety\\n\\nStep 2: Summarize the benefits.\\nHiking offers a variety of mental and physical health benefits. It promotes mental health by combating stress and anxiety, and it benefits the cardiovascular system, reducing the risk of heart disease and increasing overall fitness. Additionally, hiking can help increase levels of vitamin D and is a cost-effective and accessible hobby for anyone.\\n\\nAnswer: Hiking offers a variety of mental and physical health benefits, including promoting mental health, increasing levels of vitamin D, benefiting the cardiovascular system, reducing the risk of heart disease, increasing overall fitness, and combating symptoms of stress and anxiety.\", \"Step 1: Identify the benefits of hiking mentioned in the passages.\\n- Outdoor hiking promotes mental health.\\n- Hiking is a cardiovascular activity that benefits the cardiovascular system.\\n- Hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.\\n\\nStep 2: Compile the benefits into a single answer.\\n- Hiking promotes mental health.\\n- Hiking is a cardiovascular activity that benefits the cardiovascular system.\\n- Hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.\\n\\nFinal Answer: Hiking promotes mental health, is a cardiovascular activity that benefits the cardiovascular system, and has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.\"]", "time_sec": 21.354, "generation_time_seconds": 21.3491, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 2924, 22136, 10502, 2820, 11, 10004, 40613, 7567, 11, 323, 95078, 8464, 323, 18056, 13495, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.9013, -0.1997, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0113, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1412, -0.451, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.093, -5.857, -1.5975, -0.0091, 