{"id": "575", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action by sealing off entry points that mice could use to enter your home. Steel wool is a good material to use for this purpose as it will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, getting rid of rats and mice involves eliminating any sources of food and shelter for these rodents and preventing them from returning.", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points where the mice can enter your house. You can use steel wool pads to prevent the mice from using these entry points to get back into your house. Additionally, it is important to remove any sources of food and shelter for the mice, as they will quickly take advantage of these resources.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points where the mice can enter your house. You can use steel wool pads to prevent the mice from using these entry points to get back into your house. Additionally, it is important to remove any sources of food and shelter for the mice, as they will quickly take advantage of these resources.", "cot": "[\"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points where the mice can enter your house. You can use steel wool pads to prevent the mice from using these entry points to get back into your house. Additionally, it is important to remove any sources of food and shelter for the mice, as they will quickly take advantage of these resources.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, one should take immediate action. This involves identifying potential entry points into the house and sealing them off. For example, steel wool can be used to prevent mice from entering through pipes or vents. Additionally, removing any food sources and creating a barrier to prevent mice from returning can also be effective.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. Here are some steps you can follow:\\n\\n1. Identify entry points: Look for any small openings that mice could use to enter your house. These could be cracks in the foundation, gaps around doors or windows, or holes in walls.\\n\\n2. Seal the entry points: Once you've identified the entry points, seal them with steel wool pads. Steel wool is effective in preventing mice from entering your house because it creates a barrier that mice cannot easily navigate.\\n\\n3. Clean up: Mice are attracted to food sources, so make sure to clean up any food scraps or waste that might be attracting them to your home.\\n\\n4. Keep your home tidy: By keeping your home tidy and free of clutter, you can reduce the number of places that mice could nest or hide.\\n\\n5. Use traps: Set up traps around your home to catch any mice that may be present. There are many types of traps available, including snap traps, glue traps, and live traps.\\n\\n6. Call a professional: If you're unable to get rid of the mice on your own, consider calling a professional pest control service for help. They have the expertise and equipment to effectively eliminate mice from your home.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you should be able to quickly and effectively get rid of mice from your home.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This is a critical step to getting rid of mice. Mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting. You can prevent mice from getting back into your house by using steel wool pads inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. This will add an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.\"]", "time_sec": 22.054, "generation_time_seconds": 22.049, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 1380, 279, 23627, 646, 3725, 697, 3753, 13, 1446, 646, 990, 9509, 38540, 35995, 311, 5358, 279, 23627, 504, 1667, 1493, 4343, 3501, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 22406, 11, 432, 374, 2989, 311, 4057, 894, 8173, 315, 3607, 323, 22906, 369, 279, 23627, 11, 438, 807, 686, 6157, 1896, 9423, 315, 1493, 4963, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.2059, -0.003, -0.0001, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0116, -0.6211, -0.3676, -0.0, -0.0037, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1655, -1.0208, -1.4135, -0.0454, -0.0524, -0.8315, -0.0, -1.8147, -4.5971, -0.0, -0.1308, -0.1328, -0.0178, -0.1427, -0.4729, -2.0656, -0.0135, -0.0845, -0.0063, -0.0, -0.4003, -0.5248, -0.0075, -0.8571, -0.0, 0.0, -0.108, -1.5038, -0.1507, -0.0, -0.51, -0.0484, -0.001, -0.0048, -0.0008, -0.0102, -0.0244, -0.9831, 0.0, -0.8861, -1.0595, -0.0121, -0.0, -0.7051, -0.0001, -0.727, 0.0, -0.0, -1.3791, -0.0016, -0.8072, -0.0017, -0.0226, -0.892, -0.189, -0.0512, -0.0975, -0.0468, -0.0007, -0.0, 0.0, -3.3761, -0.196, -0.1795, -0.1782], "cumulative_logprob": -30.1648, "norm_logp": -0.3867, "input_len": 348, "output_tokens": 78, "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points where the mice can enter your house. You can use steel wool pads to prevent the mice from using these entry points to get back into your house. Additionally, it is important to remove any sources of food and shelter for the mice, as they will quickly take advantage of these resources."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 825, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 24588, 4650, 4343, 3501, 1119, 279, 3753, 323, 65834, 1105, 1007, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 9509, 38540, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 16262, 1526, 31175, 476, 80207, 13, 22406, 11, 17592, 894, 3607, 8173, 323, 6825, 264, 22103, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 13451, 646