, -0.5064, -0.0, -0.1489, -1.9168, -0.0017, -0.0027, -0.0, 0.0, -0.2271, -0.0, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.0025, -0.01, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, -2.7103, -0.3037], "cumulative_logprob": -29.5816, "norm_logp": -0.1671, "input_len": 482, "output_tokens": 177, "pred": "1. Select the appropriate shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Ensure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and adjust the flow to minimize splashing.\n3. Thoroughly wet your hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to your hand and work it through your hair. If your hair is longer, comb through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the shampoo out thoroughly.\n6. Apply a conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\n7. Rinse the conditioner out thoroughly.\n8. Use a towel to gently pat the water from your hair. Avoid rubbing it with a towel to prevent damage.\n9. Use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1249, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 3379, 279, 64558, 1417, 47595, 323, 15180, 261, 66963, 22201, 264, 61932, 323, 64324, 429, 525, 14452, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 13, 1096, 25351, 429, 279, 3871, 975, 13444, 323, 525, 21700, 389, 697, 6869, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 95275, 9959, 66963, 29279, 279, 3015, 304, 279, 17196, 374, 8205, 714, 537, 2238, 4017, 13, 27196, 279, 6396, 311, 5648, 12503, 19049, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 1001, 14438, 398, 44856, 279, 25697, 66963, 44856, 697, 6869, 26364, 311, 10549, 432, 369, 279, 61932, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 28497, 1417, 47595, 66963, 11778, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 61932, 320, 9096, 279, 1379, 315, 264, 51249, 8, 304, 697, 1424, 323, 975, 432, 1526, 697, 6869, 13, 1416, 697, 6869, 374, 5021, 11, 3614, 1526, 432, 448, 697, 19225, 311, 7949, 259, 17248, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 6587, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 49, 258, 325, 25697, 66963, 4636, 18950, 61932, 11, 73241, 279, 6869, 6587, 13, 1416, 279, 6869, 374, 5021, 11, 990, 264, 6