{"id": "48", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, also on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n\nThese steps will result in a neatly folded quilt with four even corners. Note that the size of the quilt is not specified in the passages, so these steps can be applied to quilts of any size.", "pred": "By following these steps, you can neatly fold a quilt, making it easier to handle and store.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface, such as a bed or table. \n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. \n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. \n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, keeping the fold on the bias. \n5. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n\nBy following these steps, you can neatly fold a quilt, making it easier to handle and store.", "cot": "[\"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface, such as a bed or table. \\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. \\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. \\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, keeping the fold on the bias. \\n5. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can neatly fold a quilt, making it easier to handle and store.\", \"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface such as a bed, table, or other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner of the quilt up toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner of the quilt up toward the center, also making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner of the quilt down toward the center, again ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nThese steps help in preparing the quilt for sewing binding or other finishing touches, as described in the provided passages.\", \"Answer: To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\", \"Answer: To fold a quilt, start by laying the quilt on a flat surface such as a bed or table. Next, fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. Then, fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. After that, fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, also making sure the fold is on the bias.\"]", "time_sec": 18.321, "generation_time_seconds": 18.3164, "selection_time_seconds"