b": -21.2487, "norm_logp": -0.1932, "input_len": 588, "output_tokens": 110, "pred": "To remove the rear door panel in a 2006 Chevy HHR, you need to remove two screws located inside the door pull cup and one screw in the middle of the inside door handle. Additionally, there is a pin on the outer edge of the door that holds the panel in place, which you will need to remove. Use a door panel removal tool to pry the panel off the rear door. After removing all screws and clips, gently pull the panel away from the frame and disconnect any wiring connections to completely remove the panel."}], "input_len": 588, "output_tokens": 492, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.46, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "413", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island and breed it with the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.", "pred": "[To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island, then use it to hatch an egg. After purchasing the breeding structure from the store, you combine the Shugabush Monster with the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.]", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Use the Shugabush Monster to hatch an egg.\n3. Purchase the breeding structure from the store.\n4. Use the breeding structure to combine the Shugabush Monster with the Furcorn.\n\nThe breeding process involves using the Shugabush Island breeding structure, where the combination of the Shugabush Monster and the Furcorn is essential to obtain the Shugabeats.\n\nAnswer:[To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island, then use it to hatch an egg. After purchasing the breeding structure from the store, you combine the Shugabush Monster with the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.]", "cot": "[\"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Use the Shugabush Monster to hatch an egg.\\n3. Purchase the breeding structure from the store.\\n4. Use the breeding structure to combine the Shugabush Monster with the Furcorn.\\n\\nThe breeding process involves using the Shugabush Island breeding structure, where the combination of the Shugabush Monster and the Furcorn is essential to obtain the Shugabeats.\\n\\nAnswer:[To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island, then use it to hatch an egg. After purchasing the breeding structure from the store, you combine the Shugabush Monster with the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.]\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn the Shugabush Monster into an egg by using it in the egg laying function.\\n3. Hatch the egg and then buy the breeding structure.\\n4. Use the Shugabush Monster and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\\n\\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into eggs by hatching them.\\n3. Purchase the breeding structure required for Shugabeats.\\n4. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster.\\n\\nAnswer: To breed a Shugabeats, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster, hatch them into eggs, purchase the breeding structure, and then combine Shugabush and Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island. This will turn your Shugabush Monsters into eggs.\\n2. Hatch the eggs to obtain the Shugabush Monsters.\\n3. Purchase the breeding structure for the Shugabush Island.\\n4. Breed the Shugabush and Furcorn using the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\\n\\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\"]", "time_sec": 25.555, "generation_time_seconds": 25.5452, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 1447, 16, 13, 63424, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 624, 17, 13, 5443, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 311, 43255, 458, 18636, 624, 18, 13, 30988, 279, 39208, 5944, 504, 279, 3553, 624, 19, 13, 5443, 279, 39208, 5944, 311, 15963, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 448, 279, 49840, 38630, 382, 785, 39208, 1882, 17601, 1667, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 10720, 39208, 5944, 11, 1380, 279, 10601, 315, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 323, 279, 49840, 38630, 374, 7565, 311, 6851, 279, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 382, 16141, 7259, 1249, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 6851, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 11, 1221, 990, 432, 311, 43255, 458, 18636, 13, 4636, 22577, 279, 39208, 5944, 504, 279, 3553, 11, 498, 15963, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 448, 279, 49840, 38630, 304, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 10720, 39208, 5944, 311, 633, 279, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 24719, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0103, -0.0, -0.0014, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0044, -0.0044, -0.002, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -4.5959, -0.0035, -0.0, -0.0357, -0.007, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0023, -0.0047, -0.3616, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0886, -0.0049, 0.0, -4.2947, -0.0018, -0.0008, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -1.8431, -1.1502, -1.0081, -0.5691, -0.0, -0.0076, -0.0, 0.0, -0.2248, -0.0571, -0.0965, 0.0, -3.6062, -0.0039, -0.2316, -0.0013, -0.0, 0.0, -1.0079, -0.0018, -2.094, -0.0009, -0.0089, -0.3024, -0.0005, -0.0033, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.4304, -0.5945, -0.3042, -0.0027, -0.0, -2.1544, -1.3054, -0.1279, -0.829, -1.4633, -0.2796, -0.056, -0.0073, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -4.7228, -0.0001, -0.0, -1.4004, -1.2826, -0.8379, -2.8983, -0.0004, -0.0734, -0.001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.5945, -0.0014, -0.0016, -0.0, 0.0, -0.746, -1.4614, -0.3287, -3.2481, -0.0084, -0.0476, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -2.4289, -0.0145, -1.502, -0.0284, -0.0, -