, -0.6085, -0.0006, -0.0955, -0.0002, -0.2877, -0.0067], "cumulative_logprob": -59.9326, "norm_logp": -0.324, "input_len": 425, "output_tokens": 185, "pred": "In summary, twins can be either identical (monozygotic) or fraternal (dizygotic), depending on whether they develop from one egg or two separate eggs."}], "input_len": 425, "output_tokens": 707, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 42.98, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "436", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "To find someone in France, you can use the website www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages. Enter the last name of the person in the \"Nom\" field and optionally enter their first name in the \"Prenom\" field. If you know the address, you can enter it in the \"Ou\" section. Leave it blank if you don't know the address. Click on \"Trouver\" to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number of the matching listings.", "pred": "By following these steps, you can increase your chances of finding someone in France.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To find someone in France, you can use several methods:\n\n1. **People Search Websites**: Utilize websites designed for finding people in France. For example, the website mentioned in the passage can be helpful. If you know the person's city of birth (like Paris, Avignon, Bordeaux, Lyon, Nice, etc.), you can send an email or letter to the town hall there. This can be useful if you have lost relatives in these cities.\n\n2. **French White Pages**: You can use the French white pages, which is similar to the white pages in other countries. The website is www.pagesjaunes.fr. To search effectively, make sure to use the correct fields. Instead of typing \"Paris\" in the City field, you can write \"IDF\" (Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will help you search within Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting a \"missed connection\" on Paris Craigslist.\n\n3. **Detailed Searches**: When using the white pages, you should provide as much information as possible. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field. You can also include a first name in the Prenom field if you know it. If you have address information, enter it in the Ou section. If you don't have any specific address information, leave the field blank to search the entire country.\n\nBy following these steps, you can increase your chances of finding someone in France.", "cot": "[\"To find someone in France, you can use several methods:\\n\\n1. **People Search Websites**: Utilize websites designed for finding people in France. For example, the website mentioned in the passage can be helpful. If you know the person's city of birth (like Paris, Avignon, Bordeaux, Lyon, Nice, etc.), you can send an email or letter to the town hall there. This can be useful if you have lost relatives in these cities.\\n\\n2. **French White Pages**: You can use the French white pages, which is similar to the white pages in other countries. The website is www.pagesjaunes.fr. To search effectively, make sure to use the correct fields. Instead of typing \\\"Paris\\\" in the City field, you can write \\\"IDF\\\" (Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will help you search within Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting a \\\"missed connection\\\" on Paris Craigslist.\\n\\n3. **Detailed Searches**: When using the white pages, you should provide as much information as possible. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field. You can also include a first name in the Prenom field if you know it. If you have address information, enter it in the Ou section. If you don't have any specific address information, leave the field blank to search the entire country.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can increase your chances of finding someone in France.\", \"To find someone in France, you can try several methods based on the information provided in the passages:\\n\\n1. **Using People Search Websites**: You can use websites that allow you to search for people in France. For example, the French version of the white pages, www.pagesjaunes.fr, can be helpful. You can enter the person's last name in the Nom field and, if known, a first name in the Prenom field. Additionally, you can enter any known address information in the Ou section or leave it blank to search the entire country. After entering the information, click \\\"Trouver\\\" to search for the name.\\n\\n2. **Using French White Pages**: The French version of the white pages, www.pagesjaunes.fr, is another option. You can enter the person's last name in the Nom field and, if available, a first name in the Prenom field. You can also enter any known address information in the Ou section. After entering the information, click \\\"Trouver\\\" to search for the name.\\n\\n3. **Using the French White Pages in English**: If you prefer to use the French white pages in English, you can visit the website www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. This website allows you to search for people in France, and you can enter the person's last name in the Nom field. Additionally, you can enter any known address information in the Ou section. After entering the information, click \\\"Trouver\\\" to search for the name.\\n\\n4. **Using Craigslist**: You can also try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers... This can be helpful if you are looking for someone who may have been missed or if you have lost contact with them.\\n\\n5. **Using the French White Pages with a Hint**: In the second passage, there is a hint to use the French white pages (www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en) and instead of typing \\\"Paris\\\" in the City field, write \\\"IDF\\\" or \\\"Ile de France\\\" in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs.\\n\\nUsing one or more of these methods should help you find someone in France.\", \"To find someone in France, you can follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Use People Search Websites**: Websites like Pages Blanches (www.pagesjaunes.fr) can be very helpful. You can enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the \\\"Nom\\\" field, or if you know a first name, you can enter it in the \\\"Prenom\\\" field. You can also enter address information if you know it, or leave it blank to search the entire country. Clicking \\\"Trouver\\\" will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\\n\\n2. **Use French White Pages**: The French white pages (www.pagesjaunes.fr) can be used similarly to the English version. Instead of typing \\\"Paris\\\" in the City field, write \\\"IDF\\\" (Ile de France) in the \\\"Dept district or region\\\" field to search for the person in Paris and its suburbs.\\n\\n3. **Post a Missed Connection**: If you have not seen the person for over ten or maybe even twenty years, posting a \\\"missed connection\\\" on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org) can also be helpful. This can sometimes lead to contact information or further details about the person you are trying to find.\\n\\n4. **Send Emails or Letters**: If you have lost relatives in a specific French city or town and you know they were born there, you can send an email or letter to the town hall in their city of birth.\\n\\n5. **Middle Name**: If you have the middle name of the person, it can be very helpful in narrowing down the search, as it will make things easier to identify the correct individual.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you should be able to find someone in France, depending on the availability of information and the specific circumstances.\", \"To find someone in France, you can use the French white pages accessible through the website pagesjaunes.fr. Here is a step-by-step guide based on the information provided:\\n\\n1. **Visit the Website**: Go to the website www.pagesjaunes.fr. This is the French version of the white pages.\\n2. **Enter the Last Name**: In the Nom (Last Name) field, enter the last name of the person you are searching for.\\n3. **Enter the First Name (Optional)**: You can enter the first name in the Prenom (First Name) field if you know it.\\n4. **Input Address Information**: If you have information about the address, enter it in the Ou (Where) section. If not, leave it blank to search the entire country.\\n5. **Click 'Trouver' (Find)**: After entering the necessary information, click the 'Trouver' button to search for listings that match your search criteria.\\n6. **Review the Results**: The search results will display the name, address, and phone number of all listings that match your search criteria.\\n\\nAdditionally, you can try typing \\\"IDF\\\" or \\\"Ile de France\\\" in the Dept district or region field instead of the City field to search for people in Paris and its suburbs. You can also try posting a missing person notice on Paris Craigslist or contacting the town hall in the city of birth if you have information about the birthplace of the person you are searching for.\"]", "time_sec": 52.331, "generation_time_seconds": 52.3264, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0008, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 498, 646, 990, 3807, 5413, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 15919, 7542, 63637, 95518, 10167, 551, 13037, 6188, 369, 9271, 1251, 304, 9625, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 279, 3910, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 646, 387, 10950, 13, 1416, 498, 1414, 279, 1697, 594, 3283, 315, 7194, 320, 4803, 12095, 11, 7519, 61699, 11, 83957, 11, 55201, 11, 28859, 11, 4992, 24389, 498, 646, 3624, 458, 2551, 476, 6524, 311, 279, 6290, 13994, 1052, 13, 1096, 646, 387, 5390, 421, 498, 614, 5558, 28558, 304, 1493, 9720, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 43197, 5807, 21772, 95518, 1446, 646, 990, 279, 8585, 4158, 6816, 11, 892, 374, 4428, 311, 279, 4158, 6816, 304, 1008, 5837, 13, 576, 3910, 374, 8438, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 13, 2014, 2711, 13444, 11, 1281, 2704, 311, 990, 279, 4396, 5043, 13, 12090, 315, 19496, 330, 59604, 1, 304, 279, 4311, 2070, 11, 498, 646, 3270, 330, 915, 37, 1, 320, 40, 273, 409, 9625, 8, 304, 279, 50221, 9290, 476, 5537, 2070, 13, 1096, 686, 1492, 498, 2711, 2878, 12095, 323, 1181, 46913, 