IE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "640", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some health benefits of jalapenos:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Natural nasal decongestant\n* May help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer\n* Good source of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants\n* Cardiovascular health benefits, including defending against heart health concerns and increasing cardiovascular health benefits.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What are the health benefits of jalapenos?\" can be summarized as:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Nasal decongestant\n* Anti-cancer properties\n* Cardiovascular health benefits\n* Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "pred": "Jalapeño peppers offer a variety of health benefits. They contain capsaicin, which is responsible for their heat level and provides pain-killing properties. Jalapeños are also a spicy weight loss alternative and have natural nasal decongestant properties. Additionally, they may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer. Jalapeños are also full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Answer: Jalapeño peppers offer a variety of health benefits. They contain capsaicin, which is responsible for their heat level and provides pain-killing properties. Jalapeños are also a spicy weight loss alternative and have natural nasal decongestant properties. Additionally, they may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer. Jalapeños are also full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "cot": "[\"Answer: Jalapeño peppers offer a variety of health benefits. They contain capsaicin, which is responsible for their heat level and provides pain-killing properties. Jalapeños are also a spicy weight loss alternative and have natural nasal decongestant properties. Additionally, they may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer. Jalapeños are also full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"Jalapeno peppers offer a range of health benefits, primarily due to their high levels of capsaicin. These benefits include:\\n\\n1. Pain Relief: Jalapenos contain capsaicin, which has pain-killing properties that can help alleviate pain. This can be beneficial for individuals suffering from chronic pain conditions.\\n\\n2. Weight Loss: As a spicy alternative to other foods, jalapenos can help boost metabolism and aid in weight loss. The heat from capsaicin can increase the body's metabolic rate, helping to burn more calories.\\n\\n3. Natural Nasal Decongestant: Capsaicin can also help clear nasal passages, providing a natural decongestant effect. This can be particularly helpful during colds or allergies.\\n\\n4. Cardiovascular Health: Jalapenos have been shown to have cardiovascular health benefits, including helping to defend against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure. The capsaicin in jalapenos may help improve blood circulation and reduce the risk of blood clots.\\n\\n5. Antioxidants and Nutrients: Jalapenos are rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, which are essential for overall health and can help reduce the risk of various diseases.\\n\\n6. Weight Loss: Jalapenos can also be a part of a healthy diet plan for weight loss. Consuming spicy foods like jalapenos can increase metabolism and help burn calories.\\n\\nAnswer: The health benefits of jalapenos include pain relief, weight loss, natural nasal decongestant properties, improved cardiovascular health, and being rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"The health benefits of jalapeno peppers include:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which has pain-killing properties.\\n2. Weight loss: They can be used as a spicy alternative to high-calorie foods, potentially aiding in weight loss.\\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapeno peppers can help relieve nasal congestion.\\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer.\\n5. Antioxidant content: Jalapeno peppers are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, which contribute to overall health.\\n6. Heart health: Jalapeno peppers can defend against heart health issues such as heart attack, strokes, and high blood pressure, and increase cardiovascular health benefits.\\n\\nAnswer: The health benefits of jalapeno peppers include pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant properties, cardiovascular health benefits, and being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\", \"Step 1: Identify the health benefits mentioned in the passages.\\n- Pain relief\\n- Weight loss alternative\\n- Natural nasal decongestant\\n- Possible prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer\\n- Full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants\\n- Cardiovascular health benefits\\n\\nStep 2: Summarize the benefits.\\nJalapeños offer a variety of health benefits including pain relief, being a potential weight loss alternative, aiding in nasal decongestion, and potentially preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, and have specific cardiovascular health benefits.\\n\\nStep 3: Provide a concise answer.\\nAnswer: Jalapeños offer a range of health benefits, including pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant properties, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, and are rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, with specific cardiovascular health benefits.\"]", "time_sec": 32.914, "generation_time_seconds": 32.9092, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [16141, 25, 71895, 2027, 14529, 57473, 3010, 264, 8045, 315, 2820, 7567, 13, 2379, 6644, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 374, 8480, 369, 862, 8628, 2188, 323, 5707, 6646, 12646, 9400, 5888, 13, 71895, 2027, 18219, 525, 1083, 264, 47251, 4680, 4709, 10555, 323, 61