{"id": "724", "question": "weather in wellesley", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "The weather in Wellesley from August 18 to August 22 shows a mix of sunny days and rain, with temperatures ranging from 77 to 83 degrees. There is a noticeable chance of rain (36% to 52%) in some days, and the wind speeds are relatively low, ranging from 5 to 10 mph.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Step 1: Identify the relevant information from the passages.\n- The passages provide weather forecasts for Wellesley from August 18 to August 23.\n\nStep 2: Analyze the weather conditions.\n- August 18: 83 degrees, Sunny, 42% chance of rain, 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest.\n- August 19: 83 degrees, Sunny, 42% chance of rain, 5 mph winds from the Northwest.\n- August 20: 82 degrees, Sunny, 39% chance of rain, 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest.\n- August 21: 81 degrees, Sunny, 36% chance of rain, 10 mph winds from the South.\n- August 22: 77 degrees, Moderate or heavy rain in area with thunder, 52% chance of rain, 8 mph winds from the South.\n\nStep 3: Determine the overall weather pattern.\n- The weather in Wellesley shows a mix of sunny days and rain.\n- The temperatures range from 77 to 83 degrees.\n- There is a noticeable chance of rain (36% to 52%) in some days.\n- The wind speeds are relatively low, ranging from 5 to 10 mph.\n\nFinal Answer: The weather in Wellesley from August 18 to August 22 shows a mix of sunny days and rain, with temperatures ranging from 77 to 83 degrees. There is a noticeable chance of rain (36% to 52%) in some days, and the wind speeds are relatively low, ranging from 5 to 10 mph.", "cot": "[\"Step 1: Identify the relevant information from the passages.\\n- The passages provide weather forecasts for Wellesley from August 18 to August 23.\\n\\nStep 2: Analyze the weather conditions.\\n- August 18: 83 degrees, Sunny, 42% chance of rain, 8 mph winds 