 before filling with hot water, wash one glass at a time, use a small amount of detergent only in the bottom of the glass and around the rim, and cradle the bowl of the glass in one hand while washing to protect the stem. After rinsing thoroughly with hot water, dry the wine glasses with a smooth lint-free cloth, such as a microfiber or flour sack towel."}, {"rollout": 3, "token_ids": [1249, 11369, 13078, 28147, 10277, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 1416, 4017, 3015, 323, 23034, 90134, 646, 944, 633, 697, 28147, 4240, 11, 990, 27815, 38862, 311, 4057, 894, 51396, 13078, 48132, 13, 51032, 3948, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 38862, 448, 4017, 3015, 323, 1077, 432, 2498, 304, 279, 8991, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 13, 576, 38862, 686, 72639, 894, 32147, 13078, 34951, 287, 311, 279, 8991, 382, 17, 13, 1752, 279, 4766, 315, 279, 8991, 11, 990, 264, 19101, 1664, 15625, 448, 8413, 12, 824, 309, 1411, 65943, 13, 4636, 96039, 287, 26364, 448, 4017, 3015, 11, 9058, 279, 13078, 28147, 448, 264, 10876, 57920, 12577, 27292, 11, 1741, 438, 264, 8003, 82945, 476, 19828, 52333, 42613, 382, 18, 13, 576, 61744, 15826, 1714, 369, 697, 13078, 28147, 374, 311, 44901, 1105, 553, 1424, 13, 43924, 264, 42613, 304, 279, 19309, 1573, 21274, 448, 4017, 3015, 13, 5985, 825, 13078, 8991, 518, 264, 882, 311, 5648, 5557, 13, 5443, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 90134, 323, 990, 432, 1172, 1380, 432, 594, 4362, 1177, 304, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 8991, 323, 2163, 279, 30130, 13, 4553, 71355, 279, 19212, 315, 279, 8991, 304, 825, 1424, 1393, 27686, 311, 6016, 279, 19101, 382, 16141, 25, 5985, 13078, 28147, 553, 1424, 11, 1667, 264, 19101, 1664, 15625, 448, 8413, 12, 824, 309, 1411, 65943, 11, 323, 9058, 448, 264, 57920, 12577, 27292, 13, 38478, 11, 990, 27815, 38862, 311, 4057, 51396, 13078, 48132, 11, 5310, 421, 4017, 3015, 323, 90134, 1513, 944, 975, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1651, -0.1839, -0.0001, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0116, -0.2385, -0.003, -0.0035, -0.1566, -0.0009, -0.0, -3.0517, -0.0099, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, 0.0, -0.