{"id": "272", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, cramping, nausea, and vomiting.", "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting", "cot": "[\"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\\n1. Missed period\\n2. Bloating\\n3. Spotting\\n4. Cramping\\n5. Mood swings\\n6. Dizziness\\n7. Nausea and vomiting\", \"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings due to hormonal changes, dizziness caused by blood vessel dilation and dropping blood pressure, and various other signs such as a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. These symptoms can often be easily overlooked. Nausea and vomiting are also common symptoms, with around half of pregnant women experiencing nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experiencing nausea without vomiting. Most women who have morning sickness experience symptoms around six weeks after their last period.\", \"Step 1: Identify the earliest signs and symptoms mentioned in the passages.\\n- Missed period\\n- Bloating\\n- Spotting\\n- Cramping\\n- Mood swings\\n- Dizziness\\n- Nausea and vomiting\\n\\nStep 2: Determine which of these symptoms are the earliest signs.\\n- The earliest signs are often easily overlooked, but the passages specifically mention a missed period, which is the first sign of pregnancy.\\n\\nFinal answer: The earliest sign of pregnancy is a missed period.\", \"Step 1: Identify the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy mentioned in the given passages.\\n\\nPassage 1 does not mention the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy.\\nPassage 2 states: \\\"The earliest signs of pregnancy are often easily overlooked. Many women know that a missed period may indicate pregnancy, but so can bloating, spotting, and cramping.\\\"\\n\\nStep 2: Interpret the information provided in Passage 2.\\n\\n- A missed period can indicate pregnancy.\\n- Bloating, spotting, and cramping can also indicate pregnancy.\\n\\nStep 3: Combine the information from the passages to provide a complete answer.\\n\\nAnswer: The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy, as mentioned in the given passages, are often easily overlooked. These include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping.\"]", "time_sec": 19.743, "generation_time_seconds": 19.7373, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 8906, 291, 4168, 198, 17, 13, 425, 28493, 198, 18, 13, 23297, 1280, 198, 19, 13, 4553, 30457, 198, 20, 13, 93567, 56790, 198, 21, 13, 422, 96645, 198, 22, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.9593, -0.0009, -0.0005, -0.0645, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.769, -1.1946, -0.3024, -0.0, -1.0719, 0.0, -0.0032, -1.0313, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0025, 0.0, -0.0064, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0001, 0.0, -0.0006, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.5343, -0.2664, -0.0, -0.0334, -0.0, -0.0926, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0249, -0.0, -0.2512, -0.005, 0.0, -0.0029, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0394, -0.0002, -2.0615], "cumulative_logprob": -8.719, "norm_logp": -0.1816, "input_len": 335, "output_tokens": 48, "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting"}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 19671, 56790, 4152, 311, 73118, 4344, 11, 294, 96645, 8881, 553, 6543, 26182, 74278, 323, 25100, 6543, 7262, 11, 323, 5257, 1008, 11929, 1741, 438, 