{"id": "318", "question": "how can i check taxes were filed", "gt": "Based on the given passages, you can check the status of your tax return by:\n\n1. Using the IRS2Go app on your smartphone to check the status of your tax return online.\n2. Checking the status of your tax return over the phone by calling the IRS.\n3. Checking the status of your state tax return online or over the phone.\n\nTo check the status of your tax return, you will need your Social Security number, tax filing status, and the amount of any refund due. If you e-filed your return, you can check the status 24 hours after the IRS acknowledged receipt of your return. If you mailed your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question of how to check taxes were filed is:\n\nYou can check the status of your tax return online or over the phone using the methods described above.", "pred": "You can check taxes were filed by using the IRS2Go app for Apple users, checking the status online through the IRS website, using tax software programs, or calling the IRS.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the information provided in the passages, you can check the status of your taxes in the following ways:\n\n1. **Online**: \n   - Use the IRS2Go app for Apple users from the Apple App Store.\n   - Check the status of your tax return online through the IRS website.\n   - Use tax software programs that allow checking the status of your return by logging into your account.\n\n2. **Over the Phone**:\n   - Call the IRS to check the status of your tax return.\n\nThese methods are applicable for checking the status of federal tax returns. For state tax returns, the process might differ slightly, but the general steps would involve checking online or over the phone with the relevant state tax authority.\n\nAnswer: You can check taxes were filed by using the IRS2Go app for Apple users, checking the status online through the IRS website, using tax software programs, or calling the IRS.", "cot": "[\"Based on the information provided in the passages, you can check the status of your taxes in the following ways:\\n\\n1. **Online**: \\n   - Use the IRS2Go app for Apple users from the Apple App Store.\\n   - Check the status of your tax return online through the IRS website.\\n   - Use tax software programs that allow checking the status of your return by logging into your account.\\n\\n2. **Over the Phone**:\\n   - Call the IRS to check the status of your tax return.\\n\\nThese methods are applicable for checking the status of federal tax returns. For state tax returns, the process might differ slightly, but the general steps would involve checking online or over the phone with the relevant state tax authority.\\n\\nAnswer: You can check taxes were filed by using the IRS2Go app for Apple users, checking the status online through the IRS website, using tax software programs, or calling the IRS.\", \"To check if taxes were filed, you can use the IRS2Go mobile application, which is available for Apple users through the Apple App Store. This application allows you to handle taxes online and check the status of your refund. Additionally, if you e-filed your taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours. If you mailed your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes.\", \"To check if taxes were filed, you can use the IRS2Go application for Apple users, which allows you to handle taxes online. For those who e-filed their taxes, you should be able to get a refund status within 72 hours. If you mailed your taxes, you will have to wait 3 or 4 weeks after mailing in your taxes.\", \"To check if taxes were filed, you can:\\n\\n1. Check online using a tax software program.\\n2. Log into your account on the tax software program.\\n3. Use an IRS application like IRS2Go if you are an Apple user.\\n\\nAnswer:[Yo