{"id": "414", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to first obtain a Shugabush monster from the Shugabush Island. Then, hatch the eggs obtained and purchase the breeding structure. Finally, use a Shugabush and a Furcorn in the breeding structure to create a Shugabeats monster.", "pred": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into eggs.\n3. Hatch the eggs.\n4. Purchase the breeding structure.\n5. Breed the Shugabush and Furcorn in the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\n\nIt's important to note that the breeding method (left or right) does not matter.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into eggs.\n3. Hatch the eggs.\n4. Purchase the breeding structure.\n5. Breed the Shugabush and Furcorn in the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\n\nIt's important to note that the breeding method (left or right) does not matter.", "cot": "[\"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into eggs.\\n3. Hatch the eggs.\\n4. Purchase the breeding structure.\\n5. Breed the Shugabush and Furcorn in the breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\\n\\nIt's important to note that the breeding method (left or right) does not matter.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. This can be done by completing certain tasks or missions on that island.\\n\\n2. Once you have the Shugabush Monster, it will turn into an egg. You need to hatch this egg.\\n\\n3. After hatching the Shugabush Monster, you will need to purchase the breeding structure. This structure is specifically designed for breeding Shugabeats.\\n\\n4. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to breed them.\\n\\n5. Keep in mind that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter for this particular combination.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you should be able to successfully breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island.\\n2. Turn the Shugabush Monster into an egg by using the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\\n3. Hatch the egg to get a Shugabush Monster in its egg form.\\n4. Purchase the breeding structure needed for Shugabeats breeding.\\n5. Breed the Shugabush Monster with the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\\n\\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monster into an egg by using the Shugabush breeding structure.\\n3. Hatch the egg.\\n4. Buy the Shugabeats breeding structure.\\n5. Use the Shugabush and Furcorn in the Shugabeats breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster.\\n\\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\"]", "time_sec": 25.185, "generation_time_seconds": 25.1798, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 63424, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 624, 17, 13, 11999, 697, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 62708, 1119, 18805, 6