{"id": "221", "question": "how to peel potatoes fast", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to peel potatoes fast:\n\n1. Score the potatoes all the way around the center with a knife.\n2. Boil the potatoes for about 15 minutes.\n3. Place the potatoes in a bowl of ice water and swish them around for a few seconds.\n4. Remove the potatoes from the water and remove the skin.\n\nAlternatively, you can also try the following method:\n\n1. Cut the potato skin, making a cut all around the potato lengthwise.\n2. Boil the potato in a pot of boiling water.\n3. Plunge the potato in ice water for 10 seconds.\n4. Rub the potato with both hands, and the skin should fall right off.\n\nThese methods should help you peel potatoes quickly and efficiently.", "pred": "This method helps the skin come off more easily and quickly compared to the traditional method of shocking the potatoes.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To peel potatoes fast, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Score the Potatoes**: Use a knife to score the potatoes all the way around the center. This helps the skin to come off more easily.\n\n2. **Boil the Potatoes**: Place the scored potatoes in a pot of boiling water and boil them for about 15 minutes.\n\n3. **Prepare Ice Water**: Have a bowl of ice water ready.\n\n4. **Cool the Potatoes**: Remove the potatoes from the boiling water and quickly plunge them into the ice water. Let them sit in the ice water for a few seconds.\n\n5. **Peel the Skin**: After the potatoes have cooled enough to handle, remove them from the ice water and rub the skin off with both hands.\n\nThis method helps the skin come off more easily and quickly compared to the traditional method of shocking the potatoes.", "cot": "[\"To peel potatoes fast, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Score the Potatoes**: Use a knife to score the potatoes all the way around the center. This helps the skin to come off more easily.\\n\\n2. **Boil the Potatoes**: Place the scored potatoes in a pot of boiling water and boil them for about 15 minutes.\\n\\n3. **Prepare Ice Water**: Have a bowl of ice water ready.\\n\\n4. **Cool the Potatoes**: Remove the potatoes from the boiling water and quickly plunge them into the ice water. Let them sit in the ice water for a few seconds.\\n\\n5. **Peel the Skin**: After the potatoes have cooled enough to handle, remove them from the ice water and rub the skin off with both hands.\\n\\nThis method helps the skin come off more easily and quickly compared to the traditional method of shocking the potatoes.\", \"To peel potatoes fast, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Score the Potatoes**: With a knife, make a cut all the way around the center of the potato. This step is crucial for the peeling process.\\n\\n2. **Boil the Potatoes**: Place the scored potatoes in a pot of boiling water. Boil them for about 15 minutes.\\n\\n3. **Cool the Potatoes**: After boiling, immediately transfer the potatoes to a bowl of ice water. This sudden temperature change causes the skin to loosen.\\n\\n4. **Peel the Potatoes**: Once the potatoes are cooled enough to handle, remove them from the ice water. The loosened skin will come off easily when you rub the potato with both hands.\\n\\nThis method ensures that the skin comes off quickly and efficiently, making the peeling process much faster.\", \"To peel potatoes fast, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Use a knife to score the potatoes all the way around the center.\\n2. Place the scored potatoes in a pot of boiling water.\\n3. Boil the potatoes for about 15 minutes.\\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water.\\n5. Remove the potatoes from the boiling water and place them in the ice water.\\n6. Let the potatoes sit in the ice water for a few seconds until they are cool enough to handle.\\n7. Remove the potatoes from the ice water and use your hands to peel the skin off.\\n\\nThis method helps to peel the potatoes quickly and easily.\", \"Step 1: Boil the potatoes according to the instructions in the passage. The passage suggests boiling the potatoes for about 15 minutes.\\n\\nStep 2: Prepare a bowl of ice water. The passage emphasizes the importance of this step for easy peeling.\\n\\nStep 3: Remove the potatoes from the boiling water and immediately place them in the ice water. The passage mentions that the skin will come off easily after this step.\\n\\nStep 4: Swish the potatoes in the ice water for a few seconds to cool them down enough to handle.\\n\\nStep 5: Remove the potatoes from the ice water and begin peeling. The passage suggests rubbing the potatoes with both hands to make the skin come off easily.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can peel potatoes quickly and efficiently. The key is to follow the process of shocking the potatoes (going from hot to cold) to make the peeling process easier and faster.\"]", "time_sec": 26.881, "generation_time_seconds": 26.8742, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 57112, 34167, 4937, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 10570, 279, 13706, 20187, 95518, 5443, 264, 21430, 311, 5456, 279, 34167, 678, 279, 1616, 2163, 279, 4126, 13, 1096, 8609, 279, 6787, 311, 2525, 1007, 803, 6707, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 1233, 321, 279, 13706, 20187, 95518, 10771, 279, 16548, 34167, 304, 264, 3338, 315, 49837, 3015, 323, 43690, 1105, 369, 911, 220, 16, 20, 4420, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 50590, 19939, 9959, 95518, 12243, 264, 19212, 315, 9853, 3015, 5527, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 56750, 279, 13706, 20187, 95518, 10783, 279, 34167, 504, 279, 49837, 3015, 323, 6157, 66578, 1105, 1119, 279, 9853, 3015, 13, 6771, 1105, 2444, 304, 279, 9853, 3015, 369, 264, 2421, 6486, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 10197, 301, 279, 26951, 95518, 4636, 279, 34167, 614, 64310, 3322, 311, 3705, 11, 4057, 1105, 504, 279, 9853, 3015, 323, 10273, 279, 6787, 1007, 448, 2176, 6078, 382, 1986, 1714, 8609, 279, 6787, 2525, 1007, 803, 6707, 323, 6157, 7707, 311, 279, 86