ations. In the medical field, DMSO has a range of uses, including pain relief, reducing swelling and inflammation, and promoting healing. It is particularly effective in relieving pain associated with muscles and joints when applied topically. DMSO has also been documented to aid in the treatment of soft tissue damage, local tissue death, skin ulcers, and burns. In summary, DMSO is used for pain relief, reducing inflammation, promoting healing, and treating various medical ailments."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 1887, 1995, 3897, 911, 422, 4826, 46, 304, 279, 46769, 624, 12, 422, 4826, 46, 374, 264, 553, 28645, 304, 33437, 12408, 311, 5567, 624, 12, 1084, 374, 1483, 438, 458, 3196, 333, 27633, 323, 264, 68896, 624, 12, 1084, 702, 6457, 5711, 11, 2670, 6646, 15957, 11, 17719, 54207, 11, 323, 36040, 624, 12, 1084, 702, 1012, 1483, 311, 11926, 21052, 11, 7945, 369, 8922, 15104, 11, 43054, 11, 323, 8413, 19847, 5557, 382, 8304, 220, 17, 25, 37427, 2986, 279, 3151, 5711, 9733, 624, 12, 422, 4826, 46, 374, 1483, 369, 6646, 15957, 11, 5310, 304, 23648, 323, 34258, 624, 12, 1084, 374, 1483, 311, 7949, 54207, 11, 36040, 11, 323, 11926, 21052, 624, 12, 1084, 702, 1012, 1483, 369, 5257, 6457, 81807, 11, 2670, 43054, 323, 6787, 8557, 16832, 382, 8304, 220, 18, 25, 23153, 26887, 279, 1995, 311, 4226, 279, 3405, 624, 28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 422, 4826, 46, 374, 1483, 369, 6646, 15957, 11, 17719, 54207, 11, 36040, 11, 22136, 21052, 11, 323, 26625, 5257, 6457, 81807, 11, 2670, 43054, 323, 6787, 8557, 16832, 382, 16141, 25, 422, 4826, 46, 374, 1483, 369, 6646, 15957, 11, 17719, 54207, 11, 36040, 11, 22136, 21052, 11, 323, 26625, 5257, 6457, 81807, 11, 2670, 43054, 323, 6787, 8557, 16832, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.9979, -0.0001, 0.0, -0.0, -0.127, -0.013, -1.2428, -4.8377, -2.2282, -0.5127, -0.0004, 0.0, 0.0, -0.1719, -0.0002, -0.0483, -0.1461, -0.0995, -0.0163, 0.0, 0.0, -0.3971, -1.1812, -0.0396, -0.0001, -0.1146, -0.050