{"id": "415", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's what we know about breeding a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters:\n\n* We need to breed a Shugabush Monster with a Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get a Shugabeats.\n* The breeding combination for Shugabeats is Shugabush + Furcorn.\n* Breeding left or right does not matter.\n\nTherefore, to breed a Shugabeats, you need to have a Shugabush Monster and a Furcorn, and then breed them together in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\n\nAnswer: Breed a Shugabush Monster and a Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.", "pred": "It's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter, and the breeding process may require multiple attempts due to the non-100% guarantee of successful breeding.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into eggs by using them in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\n3. Hatch the eggs.\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\n5. Breed the Shugabush and Furcorn using the breeding structure to obtain the Shugabeats.\n\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter, and the breeding process may require multiple attempts due to the non-100% guarantee of successful breeding.", "cot": "[\"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into eggs by using them in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\\n3. Hatch the eggs.\\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\\n5. Breed the Shugabush and Furcorn using the breeding structure to obtain the Shugabeats.\\n\\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter, and the breeding process may require multiple attempts due to the non-100% guarantee of successful breeding.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg by hatching them.\\n3. Purchase the breeding structure.\\n4. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to breed the Shugabeats.\\n\\nIt's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\\n3. Hatch the egg.\\n4. Purchase the breeding structure.\\n5. Breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn using the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\\n\\nNote: The breeding process does not matter whether you breed the monsters left or right.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to:\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn the Shugabush Monster into an egg.\\n3. Hatch the egg.\\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\\n5. Breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\\n\\nAnswer: To breed a Shugabeats, you need to use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\"]", "time_sec": 16.932, "generation_time_seconds": 16.9263, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 63424, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 624, 17, 13, 11999, 697, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 62708, 1119, 18805, 553, 1667, 1105, 304, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 10720, 39208, 5944, 624, 18, 13, 58894, 279, 18805, 624, 19, 13, 11292, 279, 39208, 5944, 624, 20, 13, 74152, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 