{"id": "483", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that Snapchat may lock accounts that use third-party applications to access the platform more than four times. If a user has been locked out of their account and doesn't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. Third-party apps are applications that are not developed or officially supported by Snapchat, such as third-party messaging or camera apps. Using these apps may put the user's account at risk, as well as their friends'. Additionally, there are many reasons why people are getting locked out of Snapchat, including using third-party apps.", "pred": "Based on the information provided in the passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use these third-party apps, and they may lock your account. The passages also suggest that if you are using third-party apps, the only solution is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the information provided in the passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use these third-party apps, and they may lock your account. The passages also suggest that if you are using third-party apps, the only solution is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.", "cot": "[\"Based on the information provided in the passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use these third-party apps, and they may lock your account. The passages also suggest that if you are using third-party apps, the only solution is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.\", \"Based on the provided passage, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party app to access Snapchat. The passage mentions that Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use third-party apps, and they may lock your account. If you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. The only solution mentioned is to uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.\\n\\nAnswer: Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party app to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and may result in account lockout.\", \"Based on the provided passages, the reasons for Snapchat account lockouts are primarily due to the use of third-party applications. Snapchat cannot guarantee security when third-party apps are used, which may lead to account lockouts. Users are warned by Snapchat about the risks of using such apps, and if warnings are ignored and accounts are locked, the only recourse is to uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone. Additionally, there have been instances where users have locked themselves out of their accounts by using third-party applications, and others have received warnings from Snapchat about the use of third-party apps before being locked out. The company is also taking steps to punish individuals who use these third-party apps, as evidenced by the leak of 200,000 private Snapchat photos via one of the app's many third-party apps.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\"]", "time_sec": 18.545, "generation_time_seconds": 18.5383, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0008, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28715