0.3067, "input_len": 319, "output_tokens": 140, "pred": "The color of urine can vary due to several factors. The normal color of urine is pale yellow, which is due to the pigment urochrome. However, this pale color can change in cases of kidney diseases where the filtration and selective re-absorption stages of urine production are malfunctioning. Additionally, certain foods and medications can affect urine color. For example, beetroot, berries, and fava beans can turn urine a deep purple color due to pigments in these foods. It's also important to note that red urine can be a sign of blood in the urine, which may indicate serious health issues like infections or cancer, and warrants a visit to a doctor or urologist."}, {"rollout": 3, "token_ids": [1249, 4226, 279, 3405, 330, 3423, 315, 39235, 7290, 497, 1077, 594, 23643, 1817, 21085, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 12187, 424, 220, 16, 95518, 1096, 21085, 34334, 2518, 39235, 13, 1084, 33845, 429, 2518, 39235, 646, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 6543, 304, 279, 39235, 11, 892, 646, 13216, 6001, 4682, 1075, 28920, 476, 9387, 13, 1084, 68974, 10887, 6457, 6529, 421, 279, 39235, 374, 2518, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 12187, 424, 220, 17, 95518, 1096, 21085, 13433, 911, 5538, 24932, 39235, 11, 892, 374, 264, 28583, 315, 4154, 12700, 4204, 11, 264, 8848, 19267, 13, 1084, 1083, 33845, 429, 3654, 15298, 323, 29910, 646, 2297, 279, 1894, 315, 39235, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 12187, 424, 220, 18, 95518, 1096, 21085, 34334, 279, 4622, 1894, 315, 39235, 11, 892, 374, 27539, 13753, 4152, 311, 279, 76578, 575, 299, 31902, 13, 1084, 1083, 33845, 429, 419, 1894, 646, 7025, 387, 28752, 304, 5048, 315, 37942, 18808, 382, 28715, 389, 1493, 46769, 11, 582, 646, 23583, 429, 279, 1894, 315, 39235, 646, 3410, 2989, 1995, 911, 825, 594, 2820, 13, 44763, 1447, 12, 3070, 6033, 39235, 334, 320, 28312, 304, 21085, 220, 16, 8, 646, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 6543, 304, 279, 39235, 11, 892, 2578, 13216, 6001, 4682, 624, 12, 3070, 33464, 24932, 39235, 334, 320, 28312, 304, 21085, 220, 17,