.6486, -0.312, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0011, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -5.6553, -2.1878, -0.0114, -0.0001, -0.0026, -1.2574, -0.5004, -0.512, -0.0104, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0019, 0.0, -0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.5358, -0.0034, 0.0, -0.3067, -0.0004, -0.003, 0.0, -0.019, -0.0018, -0.0, -0.005, -0.7881, -0.0056, -0.0857, -0.0, -0.0125, -0.0206, -1.1413, -0.0029, -0.001, -1.0537, -0.0002, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0031, -0.0903, -0.0004, -0.0012, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0966, -0.0022, 0.0, -0.0039, -0.0031, 0.0, -0.0001, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.1223, -0.6929, -0.0115, -1.3326, -0.0354, -0.1234, -0.9334, -0.0195, -0.0633, -0.0055, 0.0, -1.2129, -0.3758, -0.0001, -0.0135, -0.2149, -0.3409, -0.2044, -0.0, -1.0539, -0.6714, -0.0027, -0.8271, -0.3882, -0.0084], "cumulative_logprob": -26.9458, "norm_logp": -0.2616, "input_len": 367, "output_tokens": 103, "pred": "To make ice cream, follow these steps:\n\n1. Pour cold ice cream mix into an ice cream maker as directed by the manufacturer, typically for 20 to 25 minutes.\n2. Once the ice cream is softly frozen, you can serve it immediately or cover it with a piece of plastic wrap and place it in the freezer to ripen for 2 to 3 hours.\n\nThese steps provide a basic method for making ice cream, focusing on the process of churning and chilling the mixture."}], "input_len": 367, "output_tokens": 876, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "715", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest (mentioned in passage 2)\n2. Pushups with heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses (mentioned in passage 2)\n\nThese exercises are designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing for more muscle growth.", "pred": "These exercises are part of a fitness plan called The Anarchy Workout, which includes 6 weeks of high-intensity interval training to transform the body, specifically targeting chest muscles and building lean muscle all over.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the provided passages, the exercises that tone the chest include:\n\n1. A modified tri-set for the chest, designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue that surrounds them, thereby allowing more room under the skin for the muscles to grow.\n2. Pushups.\n3. Dumbbell bench presses.\n\nThese exercises are part of a fitness plan called The Anarchy Workout, which includes 6 weeks of high-intensity interval training to transform the body, specifically targeting chest muscles and building lean muscle all over.", "cot": "[\"Based on the provided passages, the exercises that tone the chest include:\\n\\n1. A modified tri-set for the chest, designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue that surrounds them, thereby allowing more room under the skin for the muscles to grow.\\n2. Pushups.\\n3. Dumbbell bench presses.\\n\\nThese exercises are part of a fitness plan called The Anarchy Workout, which includes 6 weeks of high-intensity interval training to transform the body, specifically targeting chest muscles and building lean muscle all over.\", \"The exercises mentioned in the passage that tone the chest are the modified tri-set for the chest and the pairing of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. The modified tri-set for the chest involves laying on your back with a dumbbell in each hand, extending your arms out to your side, curling your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest, and then slowly returning your arms back to your sides. The pairing of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses is another exercise that helps tone the chest.\", \"Based on the information provided in the passages:\\n\\n- The first workout involves a modified tri-set for the chest.\\n- The second chest blast involves pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\\n- An example exercise for the chest blast is described as follows: \\\"1 Lay on your back with a dumbbell in each hand. 2 Extend your arms out to your side, as if your were forming a cross. 3 Slowly, with your arms still extended, curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest. 4 Slowly return your arms back to your sides.\\\"\\n\\nStep 1: Identify the exercises mentioned in the passages.\\n- Modified tri-set for the chest.\\n- Pushups paired with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\\n\\nStep 2: Understand the purpose of these exercises.\\n- The modified tri-set is designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing more room under the skin for muscle growth.\\n- The pushups and dumbbell bench presses are used to tone the chest.\\n\\nStep 3: Summarize the information.\\n- The exercises that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pushups paired with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\\n\\nFinal Answer: The exercises that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pushups paired with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"Based on the provided passages, the exercises that tone the chest include:\\n\\n1. A modified tri-set for the chest, designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue that surrounds them. This allows more room under the skin for the muscles to grow.\\n2. Pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\\n\\nSpecifically, the modified tri-set involves:\\n- Laying on your back with a dumbbell in each hand.\\n- Extending your arms out to your side, forming a cross.\\n- Slowly curling your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest.\\n- Slowly returning your arms back to your sides.\\n\\nThese exercises are part of a 6-week high-intensity interval training program called The Anarchy Workout, which aims to transform the body and build lean muscle all over.\"]", "time_sec": 28.39, "generation_time_seconds": 28.3833, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0007, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 279, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 362, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 11, 6188, 311, 13834, 279, 30000, 82, 323, 14501, 279, 4564, 533, 19847, 429, 70274, 1105, 11, 27492, 10693, 803, 3054, 1212, 279, 6787, 369, 279, 23648, 311, 3063, 624, 17, 13, 22950, 8602, 624, 18, 13, 422, 3551, 17250, 13425, 52963, 382, 9485, 22932, 525, 949, 315, 264, 17042, 3119, 2598, 576, 1527, 15272, 69142, 11, 892, 5646, 220, 21, 5555, 315, 1550, 20052, 7968, 9873, 4862, 311, 5165, 279, 2487, 11, 11689, 24132, 15138, 23648, 323, 4752, 15651, 15747, 678, 916, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.4984, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.7692, -0.0555, -0.0226, -0.0709, -0.0471, -0.0192, -0.0018, -0.0, 0.0, -0.2106, -0.2958, -0.0067, -0.0, -2.2107, -0.0006, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0052, -0.0, 0.0, -0.2332, -0.695, -0.0, -0.0, -0.5079, -0.0003, 0.0, -0.0027, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, 0.0, -0.0, -0.4821, -0.0, -0.0, -0.6162, -0.1184, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0016, -0.0125, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0093, -0.0001, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0964, -0.0001, 0.0, -1.9745, -0.0233, -3.0341, -0.0, 0.0, -0.471, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0013, -0.2373, -0.4587, -0.0003, -0.0703, -0.0399, 0.0, -0.3478, -0.2621, -0.002, -2.107, -0.2093, 0.0, -0.0,