 toilet lift arm into the flush handle.\nStep 9: If a screw is included with your part, screw it in tightly.\nStep 10: Push it until there is no more give and it is secure.\nStep 11: The other end will hang freely in the air.\nStep 12: Connect the chain to the third hole on the lift arm.\nStep 13: Use the pliers to make sure it is securely fastened.\nStep 14: Turn the water valve back on and test out the flush of the toilet.\nStep 15: If the toilet flushes slowly, adjust the chain to make it a little tighter on the lift arm."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1249, 5046, 279, 11893, 31430, 304, 264, 26214, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 2016, 27440, 279, 9959, 29809, 44293, 95518, 5145, 553, 13054, 1007, 279, 3015, 8149, 31430, 311, 279, 26214, 311, 5358, 894, 3015, 504, 35512, 1119, 279, 12896, 1393, 498, 2299, 3238, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 13021, 279, 10621, 2988, 3106, 44293, 95518, 10627, 3641, 4057, 279, 2310, 1320, 3106, 31430, 553, 63702, 432, 1007, 279, 33639, 11715, 13, 7405, 2704, 311, 1083, 4057, 894, 10865, 11893, 8781, 429, 2578, 387, 2115, 304, 279, 11893, 6773, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 24690, 279, 1532, 2988, 3106, 44293, 95518, 29558, 279, 2310, 1320, 3106, 31430, 448, 264, 501, 825, 13, 29279, 432, 18304, 85601, 398, 1119, 279, 33639, 11715, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 38616, 279, 52435, 28525, 95518, 5264, 279, 3015, 31430, 311, 2138, 279, 12896, 311, 73715, 13, 9646, 279, 12896, 374, 2480, 11, 18198, 279, 26214, 311, 1779, 369, 6169, 5666, 13, 1416, 5871, 11, 7500, 279, 11893, 8781, 553, 7218, 279, 9317, 12327, 705, 476, 1495, 264, 5625, 315, 7746, 13, 1096, 27075, 1265, 1492, 5978, 279, 1320, 3106, 31430, 33250, 10277, 979, 279, 3705, 374, 5880, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 2271, 279, 16730, 95518, 11999, 279, 3015, 31430, 1182, 389, 323, 1273, 279, 18198, 13, 1416, 279, 26214, 18198, 288, 13970, 11, 498, 2578, 1184, 311, 66745, 279, 8781, 264, 2699, 803, 553, 7218, 279, 9317, 12327, 705, 10078, 382, 21, 13, 3070, 19357, 27196, 1368, 95518, 1416, 279, 18198, 374, 2058