t oil has a distinct aroma and flavor that is lost during refining. Refined coconut oil has a higher smoking point of 450 degrees F compared to unrefined coconut oil's 350 degrees F, making it suitable for high-temperature cooking methods like frying. Additionally, refined coconut oil is deodorized, resulting in no discernible taste or smell, whereas unrefined coconut oil carries a mild coconut flavor and aroma."}], "input_len": 333, "output_tokens": 635, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 62.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.8, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "484", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is why your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked:\n\n1. Using third-party apps to access Snapchat without authorization: According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee the security of accounts accessed through third-party apps. If you have been using such apps, it could result in your account being locked.\n2. Exceeding the limit of warnings for third-party app usage: Passage 1 mentions that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts that use third-party apps excessively. If you have exceeded the limit of warnings, your account might be temporarily locked.\n\nTherefore, the most likely reason for your Snapchat account being temporarily locked is due to the unauthorized use of third-party apps.", "pred": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you are using a third-party app to access it. Snapchat does not guarantee security when third-party apps are used, which may result in your account being locked.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the information provided in the passages:\n\n1. The passages suggest that Snapchat locks accounts when third-party apps are used to access it.\n2. This is because Snapchat cannot guarantee security when third-party apps are used.\n3. The first passage mentions that the user changed their password and the account was unlocked, but on the fourth attempt, it failed.\n4. The second passage provides more details, stating that Snapchat sends a warning message before locking an account and that using third-party apps may be the reason for being locked out.\n5. It also mentions that the only solution for users using third-party apps is to uninstall the app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.\n6. The third passage indicates that Snapchat is taking steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could be another reason for an account being locked.\n\nFinal Answer: Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you are using a third-party app to access it. Snapchat does not guarantee security when third-party apps are used, which may result in your account being locked.", "cot": "[\"Based on the information provided in the passages:\\n\\n1. The passages suggest that Snapchat locks accounts when third-party apps are used to access it.\\n2. This is because Snapchat cannot guarantee security when third-party apps are used.\\n3. The first passage mentions that the user changed their password and the account was unlocked, but on the fourth attempt, it failed.\\n4. The second passage provides more details, stating that Snapchat sends a warning message before locking an account and that using third-party apps may be the reason for being locked out.\\n5. It also mentions that the only solution for users using third-party apps is to uninstall the app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.\\n6. The third passage indicates that Snapchat is taking steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could be another reason for an account being locked.\\n\\nFinal Answer: Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you are using a third-party app to access it. Snapchat does not guarantee security when third-party apps are used, which may result in your account being locked.\", \"Based on the information provided in the passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. The passages suggest that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock the account. Specifically, the account may be locked after receiving warnings from Snapchat about the use of third-party apps.\\n\\nTo summarize, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party app to access Snapchat, which led to a temporary lockout of your account.\", \"Step 1: Identify the key information related to Snapchat accounts being locked.\\n- Third-party apps may lock your Snapchat account.\\n- Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use third-party apps.\\n- They will usually send you a message before they do so.\\n- If you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason.\\n\\nStep 2: Analyze the given passage to find the specific reason for a Snapchat account being locked.\\n- The passage mentions that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if you use third-party apps.\\n- It also states that third-party apps may lock your account.\\n- There is no mention of temporary locking, but it implies that using third-party apps can lead to permanent account lockout.\\n\\nStep 3: Formulate the answer based on the identified information.\\n- The reason for a Snapchat account being locked is due to the use of third-party apps, which may lead to account lockout.\\n\\nFinal Answer: Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you are using third-party apps.\", \"Step 1: Analyze the passage to identify the key points related to Snapchat account locking.\\n- Third-party apps can lock Snapchat accounts.\\n- Snapchat sends a warning message before locking an account.\\n- Using third-party apps may lead to account lockout.\\n- The only known solution is to uninstall the third-party app and wait for the official Snapchat app to appear.\\n\\nStep 2: Determine the reason for the temporary lock based on the information provided.\\n- The passage mentions that using third-party apps can lead to account lockout.\\n- It also states that Snapchat sends a warning message before locking an account.\\n- The user's account was locked after receiving a warning message.\\n\\nStep 3: Formulate the answer based on the analysis.\\nThe user's Snapchat account was temporarily locked because they were using a third-party app to access Snapchat. Snapchat sends a warning message before locking an account, and the user's account was locked after receiving this warning.\\n\\nAnswer: Your Snapchat account was temporarily locked because you were using a third-party app to access Snapchat. Snapchat sends a warning message before locking an account, and your account was locked after receiving this warning.\"]", "time_sec": 33.454, "generation_time_seconds": 33.4458, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 1447, 16, 13, 576, 46769, 4190, 429, 55179, 31676, 9618, 979, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 311, 2615, 432, 624, 17, 13, 1096, 374, 1576, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 979, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 624, 18, 13, 576, 1156, 21085, 33845, 429, 279, 1196, 5497, 862, 3552, 323, 279, 2692, 572, 35618, 11, 714, 389, 279, 11737, 4774, 11, 432, 4641, 624, 19, 13, 576, 2086, 21085, 5707, 803, 3565, 11, 27798, 429, 55179, 21308, 264, 9958, 1943, 1573, 37855, 458, 2692, 323, 429, 1667, 4843, 24031, 10500, 1231, 387, 279, 2874, 369, 1660, 16061, 700, 624, 20, 13, 1084, 1083, 33845, 429, 279, 1172, 6291, 369, 3847, 1667, 4843, 24031, 10500, 374, 311, 53635, 279, 906, 323, 3783, 369, 458, 3946, 55179, 906, 311, 4994, 369, 279, 5515, 14307, 624, 21, 13, 576, 4843, 21085, 14807, 429, 55179, 374, 4633, 7354, 311, 31051, 7775, 879, 990, 4843, 24031, 10500, 11, 892, 1410, 387, 2441, 2874, 369, 458, 2692, 1660, 16061, 382, 19357, 21806, 25, 4615, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 525, 1667, 264, 4843, 24031, 906, 311, 2615, 432, 13, 55179, 1558, 537, 15440, 4763, 979, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 892, 1231, 1102, 304, 697, 2692, 1660, 16061, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.537, -0.0, -0.0, -0.687, -0.016, -0.0218, -0.0, -0.0591, -2.5804, -0.0078, -0.0, -0.1527, -1.587, -2.5454, -0.0002, -0.4873, -0.6851, -0.0144, -0.9114, -0.2188, -0.0001, -0.0232, -0.0001, -0.0102, -0.0854, -0.0071, -1.5548, -0.2109, -0.0, 0.0, -3.0565, -0.9385, -0.309, -0.0012, -0.0