{"id": "571", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to perform skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Press and hold the LT button on the Xbox controller, followed by a quick tap of the RB button.\n\nThat's it! This combination will allow you to perform the ball juggling skill move while standing on the field in FIFA 16 on Xbox One.", "pred": "To perform skill moves in FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you would use the button combinations mentioned in the passage. Specifically, for the Ball Juggle skill move, you would hold down the LT (left trigger) button and tap the RB (right bumper) button. This combination allows you to execute the skill move on the Xbox One console.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To perform skill moves in FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you would use the button combinations mentioned in the passage. Specifically, for the Ball Juggle skill move, you would hold down the LT (left trigger) button and tap the RB (right bumper) button. This combination allows you to execute the skill move on the Xbox One console.", "cot": "[\"To perform skill moves in FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you would use the button combinations mentioned in the passage. Specifically, for the Ball Juggle skill move, you would hold down the LT (left trigger) button and tap the RB (right bumper) button. This combination allows you to execute the skill move on the Xbox One console.\", \"To execute the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use specific button combinations. For example, to perform the Ball Juggle skill move while standing, you should hold the LT (left trigger) button and tap the RB (right bumper) button.\", \"To perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for the Xbox One, you need to use specific button combinations. For example, to execute the Ball Juggle skill move, you should hold the LT button and tap the RB button while standing. This information is provided in Passage 1.\", \"To perform the skill move \\\"Ball Juggle (while standing)\\\" on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button while standing.\"]", "time_sec": 12.495, "generation_time_seconds": 12.4888, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 2736, 9947, 10797, 304, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 498, 1035, 990, 279, 3137, 27459, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 13, 44763, 11, 369, 279, 12836, 619, 49328, 9947, 3271, 11, 498, 1035, 3331, 1495, 279, 34469, 320, 2359, 8183, 8, 3137, 323, 15239, 279, 27974, 320, 1291, 58885, 8, 3137, 13, 1096, 10601, 6147, 498, 311, 9026, 279, 9947, 3271, 389, 279, 20577, 3776, 2339, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.1331, -0.6197, -1.5039, -0.0, -1.1943, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, -2.2009, -0.1206, -0.0, -0.0056, -0.0771, -5.1772, -0.1374, -0.3815, -1.0751, -0.0287, -0.7948, -0.0591, -0.0272, -0.3471, -0.0385, -0.0456, -0.0003, -0.0349, -0.0331, -0.1273, 0.0, -0.0, -0.6037, -0.0, -0.2283, -0.1099, -0.4221, -0.0471, -2.1205, -0.0234, -0.6135, -1.6675, -1.054, -0.0059, -0.0, -0.0031, -0.0284, -0.079, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0211, -0.0, -0.0, -0.384, -1.0969, -0.0959, -0.2175, -0.0158, -0.0, -0.0188, -0.011, -0.2868, -0.0001, -1.0029, -0.1065, -0.0031, -0.0059, -0.0002, -0.029, -0.0319], "cumulative_logprob": -24.4969, "norm_logp": -0.345, "input_len": 375, "output_tokens": 71, "pred": "To perform skill moves in FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you would use the button combinations mentioned in the passage. Specifically, for the Ball Juggle skill move, you would hold down the LT (left trigger) button and tap the RB (right bumper) button. This combination allows you to execute the skill move on the Xbox One console."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1249, 9026, 279, 9947, 10797, 389, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 990, 3151, 3137, 27459, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 3