{"id": "627", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay close to them when they are near the three-point line, actively sliding your feet to minimize shot opportunities (passage 1). It is important to create a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (passage 3).", "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter when you guard them near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter when you guard them near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.", "cot": "[\"To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter when you guard them near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them near the three-point line, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, you can upload a video on basketball defense to learn more tips from an experienced basketball player.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, follow these steps:\\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player. For example, when guarding a tall player near the three-point line, you should aim to stay close to them to minimize their shot opportunities.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent. This movement helps you maintain your position and prevent the tall player from finding an open space to shoot or drive to the basket.\\n3. If the tall player is particularly tall, consider using a wedge technique. This involves positioning yourself between the basket and the offensive player, creating a barrier that the tall player must go around to get to the basket.\\n4. Take advantage of your height or position relative to the tall player. For example, if you are a 6'6 guard and the tall player is 7'2, you can use your height to your advantage by staying close to them and limiting their shooting range.\\n5. Be flexible and adapt to the situation. If the tall player is particularly tall and difficult to guard, consider using a different strategy or adjusting your approach based on the specific player and game situation.\\nBy following these steps, you can effectively guard a tall person in basketball, even if they are larger or taller than you.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them. This can be achieved by actively sliding your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize their shot opportunities. Additionally, it's important to go with the cards you are dealt, meaning you need to adapt to your position and the height of your opponent.\"]", "time_sec": 21.903, "generation_time_seconds": 21.8973, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 4717, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 279, 16217, 11, 25530, 31571, 979, 498, 7616, 1105, 3143, 279, 2326, 16574, 1555, 13, 3218, 3132, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 4717, 3143, 697, 14704, 323, 29337, 6552, 10488, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.136, -0.0029, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0044, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0143, -2.5957, -0.0645, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0007, -0.9812, -0.0289, -0.8321, -0.0, -0.0067, -0.6904, -0.8166, -0.008, -3.1685, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, -0.004, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0001, 