4, "output_tokens": 402, "pred": "The nervous system and the endocrine system have several similarities and differences. Both systems are crucial for maintaining homeostasis and are regulated by negative feedback mechanisms. They both use chemical messengers (neurotransmitters and hormones, respectively) to communicate with target cells or organs. However, they differ significantly in their composition, with the nervous system being made of neuron cells and the endocrine system composed of glands. Additionally, the nervous system transmits signals through electrochemical pulses, while the endocrine system uses hormones and relies on the circulatory system for signal transmission. The nervous system is continuous and interconnected, whereas the endocrine system's organs are discrete and not physically connected."}, {"rollout": 3, "token_ids": [34402, 1361, 510, 16, 13, 11733, 5942, 525, 28229, 311, 20337, 2114, 535, 10718, 624, 17, 13, 2379, 525, 34219, 553, 8225, 11055, 23783, 624, 18, 13, 35324, 9435, 14886, 525, 2989, 304, 2176, 5942, 382, 35, 58326, 510, 16, 13, 28596, 25, 576, 22596, 1849, 374, 1865, 705, 315, 48284, 7761, 11, 1393, 279, 3972, 77638, 739, 374, 1865, 705, 315, 81275, 624, 17, 13, 47025, 25, 576, 22596, 1849, 5711, 24394, 30956, 65457, 11, 19853, 279, 3972, 77638, 739, 5711, 43215, 624, 18, 13, 11032, 25, 576, 22596, 1849, 374, 19259, 323, 82316, 11, 1393, 279, 35753, 315, 279, 3972, 77638, 739, 525, 43179, 323, 537, 21893, 8433, 624, 19, 13, 27230, 18368, 25, 576, 22596, 1849, 59780, 33213, 369, 8286, 18368, 11, 1393, 279, 3972, 77638, 739, 5711, 279, 4225, 37120, 1849, 369, 8286, 18368, 382, 16141, 7259, 34402, 1361, 25, 11733, 5942, 10306, 2114, 535, 10718, 11, 525, 34219, 553, 8225, 11055, 23783, 11, 323, 990, 11483, 9435, 14886, 13, 85797, 25, 576, 22596, 1849, 374, 1865, 315, 48284, 7761, 11, 5711, 24394, 30956, 65457, 369, 18368, 11, 374, 19259, 323, 82316, 11, 323, 59780, 33213, 369, 8286, 18368, 13, 576, 3972, 77638, 739, 374, 1865, 315, 