nes can result in compression without a fall or an injury."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 264, 2088, 315, 13495, 2670, 10968, 323, 15386, 1182, 6646, 11, 892, 646, 46193, 268, 979, 11259, 476, 11435, 13, 1096, 6646, 3545, 14807, 264, 49012, 25111, 58804, 11, 264, 1841, 315, 7469, 24854, 13, 506, 5342, 88666, 10704, 6646, 374, 11136, 8975, 1526, 23221, 11, 1741, 438, 916, 10603, 63189, 6646, 58544, 3004, 1075, 64702, 8608, 5127, 268, 11, 24663, 258, 11, 18668, 96101, 30353, 11, 323, 25859, 54789, 268, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 2990, 311, 77232, 11, 7945, 304, 279, 34676, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 85778, 11, 323, 646, 1102, 304, 264, 4709, 315, 2608, 323, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 916, 882, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.1006, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.4417, -0.2612, -0.0, -1.3291, -2.9165, 0.0, -0.0002, -0.7653, -0.7735, -3.3692, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0439, -2.1376, -1.9578, -0.4972, -0.0, -0.1188, -0.0535, -0.0, -0.0, -0.4053, -0.8949, -0.0094, -0.8529, -0.408, -0.0097, -0.0029, -0.0, 0.0, -0.1057, -0.1207, -0.0484, -0.0006, -0.1192, -0.0003, -0.0026, -6.2408, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.4776, -0.6809, -1.3086, -0.0189, -0.3627, -0.0972, -0.004, -0.3602, 0.0, -0.0003, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0013, -0.0671, 0.0, -0.0355, -0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.004, -0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0011, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0351, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.2522, -2.3701, -0.2137, -0.0, -0.2653, -0.0202, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0109, -0.0011, 0.0, -0.0148, -0.5954, -0.6957, -0.0, -0.0082, -0.0, -0.8224, -0.0001, -0.0004, -0.5073, -0.0004, -0.2544, -0.7965, -0.5695, -0.9087, -0.0044, -0.5403, -0.0435, -0.0, -0.0, -0.5431, -0.098, -0.0001, -0.0, 0.0, -0.2407, 0.0, -0.0075, -0.0663], "cumulative_logprob": -38.2937, "norm_logp": -0.3218, "input_len": 576, "output_tokens": 119, "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by a range of symptoms including sudden and severe back pain, which can worsen when standing or walking. This pain often indicates a spinal compression fracture, a sign of weak bones. Osteoporosis pain is typically managed through medication, such as over-the-counter pain relievers like acetaminophen, aspirin, ibuprofen, and naproxen. Without treatment, severe osteoporosis can lead to fractures, particularly in the spine, hips, or wrists, and can result in a loss of height and a stooped posture over time."}, {"rollout": 2, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 387, 31871, 553, 3807, 13495, 323, 4682, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 1514, 19289, 6841, 34467, 95518, 576, 21085, 33845, 429, 10968, 11, 15386, 1182, 6646, 11, 5310, 304, 9014, 3198, 11, 3545, 77764, 264, 49012, 25111, 58804, 11, 892, 374, 264, 1841, 315, 7469, 24854, 13, 1096, 6646, 11136, 5221, 10960, 979, 11259, 476, 11435, 323, 1231, 387, 50412, 553, 20446, 1495, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 3640, 24704, 95518, 24704, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 374, 2441, 48548, 315, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 13, 1096, 14807, 429, 279, 24854, 614, 1012, 57664, 323, 1231, 614, 28268, 476, 30649, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 22560, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 15058, 50213, 68, 11, 31630, 1671, 11, 472, 3077, 11, 476, 6944, 71299, 95518, 576, 21085, 11689, 33845, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 438, 13495, 315, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 13, 4220, 77232, 646, 12170, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 85307, 315, 15533, 2869, 531, 1413, 95518, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 4623, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 382, 641, 12126, 11, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 15386, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 11, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 