lize warm season grasses when the grass begins to turn green at the beginning of spring. Additionally, it's important to know your grass type, do a pH soil test, and measure your lawn. The passage also suggests pouring in the rest of the fertilizer in a perpendicular pattern and checking if the lawn is in good shape by stepping on the turf and observing if the leaf blade bounces back up or lays flat. If it lays flat, it indicates that you've over-fertilized."}, {"rollout": 3, "token_ids": [785, 6169, 1616, 311, 35114, 551, 697, 16359, 11, 3118, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 17601, 3807, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 62805, 95518, 434, 85695, 551, 518, 279, 1290, 882, 315, 1042, 11, 11689, 518, 279, 7167, 315, 279, 7826, 3200, 369, 8205, 3200, 16359, 288, 979, 279, 16359, 12033, 311, 2484, 6176, 518, 279, 7167, 315, 10464, 13, 1096, 25351, 429, 279, 64291, 4278, 1850, 323, 374, 41001, 553, 279, 16359, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 929, 315, 39946, 95518, 14187, 697, 16359, 943, 11, 438, 2155, 4494, 315, 16359, 288, 1373, 2155, 4494, 315, 35114, 12230, 323, 2155, 11639, 315, 35114, 2022, 13, 1096, 1995, 8609, 304, 18774, 279, 8311, 64291, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 79, 39, 75519, 3393, 95518, 49835, 264, 36043, 17171, 1273, 311, 6629, 279, 17171, 594, 65687, 13489, 476, 96926, 13, 1096, 8609, 304, 25597, 279, 8311, 36043, 2188, 369, 279, 64291, 13, 1096, 3019, 374, 16587, 369, 22573, 429, 279, 64291, 374, 7373, 323, 3171, 944, 11428, 279, 16359, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 32236, 4615, 68392, 95518, 34104, 279, 3082, 315, 697, 36025, 311, 8253, 279, 3311, 315, 64291, 4362, 13, 1096, 25351, 429, 498, 3796, 279, 4396, 3311, 11, 13866, 2238, 2632, 6329, 2238, 1753, 11, 892, 1410, 2990, 311, 1212, 5279, 413, 3304, 476, 38432, 35114, 1506, 16359, 11, 15576, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 4988, 95518, 20552, 279, 64291, 41047, 3941, 279, 36025, 13, 758, 279, 3897, 21085, 11, 432, 374, 11827, 311, 4914, 279, 2732, 315, 279, 64291, 304, 264, 76833, 5383, 13, 1096, 1714, 8609, 304, 49712, 279, 64291, 77809, 3941, 279, 3602