{"id": "485", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, it appears that your Snapchat account has been temporarily locked due to using third-party apps. According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee security when using third-party apps, and they may lock your account if they detect such usage. Passage 3 also mentions that Snapchat has taken steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could result in account lockout.\n\nIt's possible that you have been warned multiple times by Snapchat about using third-party apps, as mentioned in passage 1, and your account has been locked as a result. To regain access to your account, you may need to stop using third-party apps and wait for an official Snapchat app to become available for your device, as suggested in passage 2.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "[\"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Answer: Snapchat may lock your account if you use third-party apps to access it, as the company cannot guarantee your security if you do. They usually send a warning message before locking your account. If you have been locked out and are unsure of the reason, third-party apps may be the cause. The only solution is to uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"The Snapchat account is temporarily locked because the user is using a third-party application to access Snapchat, putting themselves and possibly their friends at risk.\"]", "time_sec": 10.006, "generation_time_seconds": 9.9975, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.162, 0.0, -0.