 450°F). Remove the ribs from the foil and place them meaty-side up on the grill. Brush them with some of the sauce. Cover the grill and cook for 5 minutes. Flip the ribs and brush them with more sauce. Cook for another 5 minutes. Continue to cook, flipping and brushing every 5 minutes, until the sauce has thickened and the ribs are heated through and have grill marks. This should take a total grilling time of 20 minutes."}, {"rollout": 2, "token_ids": [1249, 1281, 55149, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 1416, 1081, 9400, 11, 8628, 264, 6819, 476, 60103, 39058, 311, 11051, 320, 18, 20, 15, 58472, 311, 220, 19, 20, 15, 58472, 568, 1416, 23387, 22471, 10823, 11, 10549, 279, 23387, 553, 855, 383, 1095, 432, 311, 279, 8311, 9315, 382, 17, 13, 1416, 1081, 9400, 11, 4057, 279, 55149, 504, 279, 46399, 11, 1992, 1105, 13041, 88, 24067, 705, 389, 279, 39058, 11, 323, 15625, 1105, 448, 1045, 315, 279, 19187, 13, 17757, 279, 39058, 323, 4296, 369, 220, 20, 4420, 13, 40284, 323, 15625, 279, 55149, 323, 4296, 2441, 220, 20, 4420, 13, 15003, 311, 4296, 11, 64661, 323, 76726, 1449, 220, 20, 4420, 11, 3080, 279, 19187, 702, 12045, 6758, 323, 279, 55149, 525, 31713, 1526, 323, 614, 39058, 15423, 11, 369, 264, 2790, 1081, 9400, 882, 315, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 382, 18, 13, 1416, 23387, 22471, 10823, 11, 4057, 279, 38554, 504, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 55149, 13, 5443, 264, 21430, 311, 1191, 432, 3143, 279, 15026, 835, 11, 323, 6815, 1007, 304, 825, 6573, 13, 10224, 279, 55149, 304, 264, 312, 325, 278, 480, 8968, 13, 2691, 14016, 45277, 19187, 311, 3421, 13, 7083, 279, 27815, 7215, 448, 8811, 14189, 46399, 13, 5443, 11260, 315, 49817, 46399, 311, 1281, 264, 15632, 382, 19, 13, 14263, 279, 55149, 25, 19219, 279, 64307, 323, 279, 14473, 16205, 11, 421, 1667, 11, 323, 15625, 279, 55149, 389, 2176, 11067, 13, 15515, 35144, 279, 55149, 448, 279, 9058, 10273, 323, 3272, 29273, 311, 1281, 2704, 279, 10273, 34951, 288, 311, 279, 20131, 13041, 382, 20, 13, 49848, 476, 23387, 22471, 562, 279, 55149, 