{"id": "629", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some strategies for guarding a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard them near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities (Passage 1).\n2. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is important to stay close to them and create a barrier between them and the basket. These strategies can help limit their shooting opportunities and make it more difficult for them to score.", "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to the tall player. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to the tall player. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.", "cot": "[\"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to the tall player. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\\n\\n1. Stay close to the tall player, particularly near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize their shot opportunities.\\n3. Maintain a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to effectively defend against their tall stature.\\n4. Utilize tips from an experienced basketball player to enhance your defensive strategy.\\n\\nThese methods, as outlined in the passages, will help you effectively guard a tall person in basketball.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player when guarding him near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense against tall players.\"]", "time_sec": 14.475, "generation_time_seconds": 14.4712, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 498, 1265, 4717, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 279, 16217, 2781, 13, 3218, 3132, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 4717, 3143, 697, 14704, 323, 29337, 6552, 10488, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.136, -0.0029, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0044, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0143, -0.5124, -0.0656, -0.2851, -0.0963, -0.0, -0.0008, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.8549, -0.0155, -0.457, -3.0251, -0.2765, -0.0, -0.0051, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0012, -0.0336, -0.0003, -0.0435, -0.0, -0.0065, -0.0001, -0.044, 0.0, -0.0553, -1.0212], "cumulative_logprob": -6.9589, "norm_logp": -0.174, "input_len": 323, "output_tokens": 40, "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to the tall player. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1249, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 498, 1265, 1447, 16, 13, 28737, 3265, 311, 279, 16217, 2781, 11, 7945, 3143, 279, 2326, 16574, 1555, 624, 17, 13, 3218, 3132, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 4717, 3143, 697, 