{"id": "46", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "First, lay the quilt on a flat surface. Next, fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. Then, fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias. After that, fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "First, lay the quilt on a flat surface. Next, fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. Then, fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias. After that, fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "cot": "[\"First, lay the quilt on a flat surface. Next, fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. Then, fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias. After that, fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\", \"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface like a bed, table, or other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, again ensuring the fold is on the bias.\", \"1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\", \"To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface, such as a bed, table, or any other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner of the quilt up toward the center, ensuring that the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner of the quilt up toward the center, also making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner of the quilt down toward the center, again ensuring that the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, making sure the fold is on the bias as well.\\n\\nThese steps should help you fold your quilt neatly and efficiently.\"]", "time_sec": 17.342, "generation_time_seconds": 17.3385, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [5338, 11, 10962, 279, 60736, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 13, 9295, 11, 11555, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 3259, 2704, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 5005, 11, 11555, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 1083, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 4636, 429, 11, 11555, 279, 1909, 2115, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 1549, 3259, 2704, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 17375, 11, 11555, 279, 1909, 1290, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4