{"id": "100", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "gt": "To sync an audiobook from iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n\n1. Open iTunes on your computer.\n2. Turn on the Manually manage music setting in iTunes.\n3. Download the audiobook from iTunes onto your iPhone.\n4. Connect your iPhone to the USB cable and plug the other end of the USB cable into a USB port on the computer.\n5. Wait for iTunes to sync the audiobook to your iPhone.\n6. After the sync is complete, the audiobook will be on your iPhone.", "pred": "By following these steps, you can successfully sync an audiobook from your iPhone to iTunes, making it accessible for playback on your device.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the information provided in the passages, the process to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes involves the following steps:\n\n1. **Download the audiobook from iTunes**: This is the first step in both of the provided passages. You need to download the audiobook you want from iTunes.\n\n2. **Connect your iPhone to the computer**: The second step involves connecting your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable. This allows you to transfer files between the two devices.\n\n3. **Open iTunes and select the audiobook**: You need to open iTunes on your computer and navigate to the \"Audiobooks\" section. From there, you can select the audiobook you want to sync.\n\n4. **Start the sync process**: With the audiobook selected, you can initiate the sync process in iTunes. This involves clicking on the sync icon or selecting the \"Sync Audiobooks\" option.\n\n5. **Choose books or audiobooks to sync**: Depending on your preference, you can choose to sync specific audiobooks or select all audiobooks on your iPhone.\n\n6. **Apply the changes**: After selecting the audiobooks you want to sync, click on the \"Apply\" button at the bottom of the iTunes window to complete the sync process.\n\nBy following these steps, you can successfully sync an audiobook from your iPhone to iTunes, making it accessible for playback on your device.", "cot": "[\"Based on the information provided in the passages, the process to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes involves the following steps:\\n\\n1. **Download the audiobook from iTunes**: This is the first step in both of the provided passages. You need to download the audiobook you want from iTunes.\\n\\n2. **Connect your iPhone to the computer**: The second step involves connecting your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable. This allows you to transfer files between the two devices.\\n\\n3. **Open iTunes and select the audiobook**: You need to open iTunes on your computer and navigate to the \\\"Audiobooks\\\" section. From there, you can select the audiobook you want to sync.\\n\\n4. **Start the sync process**: With the audiobook selected, you can initiate the sync process in iTunes. This involves clicking on the sync icon or selecting the \\\"Sync Audiobooks\\\" option.\\n\\n5. **Choose books or audiobooks to sync**: Depending on your preference, you can choose to sync specific audiobooks or select all audiobooks on your iPhone.\\n\\n6. **Apply the changes**: After selecting the audiobooks you want to sync, click on the \\\"Apply\\\" button at the bottom of the iTunes window to complete the sync process.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can successfully sync an audiobook from your iPhone to iTunes, making it accessible for playback on your device.\", \"To sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Launch iTunes** on your computer and connect your iPhone to the PC using the USB cable.\\n2. **Click on the name of your iPhone** under the Devices section in the left column of iTunes.\\n3. **Navigate to the Books section** above the main iTunes window.\\n4. **Select the audiobooks** you want to transfer. You can choose specific audiobooks or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n5. **Click Sync Audiobooks** and then choose the audiobooks you want to transfer or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n6. **Click Apply** at the bottom of the screen to finish the syncing process.\\n7. **Import** any new audiobooks from your PC to your iOS devices.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can successfully sync audiobooks from your iPhone to iTunes.\", \"Answer: To sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. **Launch iTunes**: Open iTunes on your computer.\\n2. **Connect Your Device**: Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\\n3. **Select Your Device**: In iTunes, under the \\\"Devices\\\" section, click on the name of your iPhone.\\n4. **Navigate to Audiobooks**: In the main iTunes window, go to the \\\"Books\\\" tab.\\n5. **Select Audiobooks**: Choose the audiobooks you want to sync from the list.\\n6. **Sync Audiobooks**: Click on \\\"Sync Audiobooks\\\" and then select the audiobooks you want to transfer or choose \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n7. **Apply Changes**: Click \\\"Apply\\\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can successfully sync audiobooks from your iPhone to iTunes.\", \"Syncing audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes involves the following steps:\\n\\n1. Launch iTunes on your computer and connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\\n2. In iTunes, click on the name of your iPhone under the \\\"Devices\\\" section on the left column.\\n3. In the main iTunes window, click on the \\\"Books\\\" section.\\n4. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer from the list of available audiobooks.\\n5. Click on \\\"Sync Audiobooks,\\\" and then choose the audiobooks you want to transfer or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them to your iPhone.\\n6. Click \\\"Apply\\\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.\\n7. If you want to add new audiobooks from your PC to your iOS device, click on \\\"Import.\\\"\\n8. Syncios Audiobook Transfer is a two-way transfer tool that allows you to not only backup files to your PC but also transfer audiobooks from your PC to your iPod, iPhone, or iPad.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can successfully sync audiobooks from your iPhone to iTunes on your computer.\"]", "time_sec": 30.373, "generation_time_seconds": 30.3689, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 279, 1882, 311, 12811, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 17601, 279, 2701, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 11377, 279, 46368, 73328, 504, 13025, 95518, 1096, 374, 279, 1156, 3019, 304, 2176, 315, 279, 3897, 46769, 13, 1446, 1184, 311, 4139, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 504, 13025, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 14611, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 95518, 576, 2086, 3019, 17601, 20913, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 13, 1096, 6147, 498, 311, 8317, 3542, 1948, 279, 1378, 7611, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 5002, 13025, 323, 3293, 279, 46368, 73328, 95518, 1446, 1184, 311, 1787, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 323, 20876, 311, 279, 330, 32, 20536, 674, 14685, 1, 3772, 13, 5542, 1052, 11, 498, 646, 3293, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 3479, 279, 12811, 1882, 95518, 3085, 279, 46368, 73328, 4091, 11, 498, 646, 38101, 279, 12811, 1882, 304, 13025, 13, 1096, 17601, 18458, 389, 279, 12811, 4603, 476, 26301, 279, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 2999, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 24051, 6467, 476, 46368, 674, 14685, 311, 12811, 95518, 39630, 389, 697, 21933, 11, 498, 646, 5157, 311, 12811, 3151, 46368, 674, 14685, 476, 3293, 678, 46368, 674, 14685, 389, 697, 12167, 382, 21, 13, 3070, 28497, 279, 4344, 95518, 4636, 26301, 279, 46368, 674, 14685, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 11, 4205, 389, 279, 330, 28497, 1, 3137, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 13025, 3241, 311, 4583, 279, 12811, 1882, 38