{"id": "189", "question": "how long does it take to make chicken tender in crock pot", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the answer to the question \"How long does it take to make chicken tender in a crock pot?\" is:\n\n6-8 hours on low heat, or 4 hours on high heat if you're short on time.\n\nThe first passage suggests cooking the chicken on low for 6-8 hours, or 1 hour on high and then 5 hours on low. The second passage repeats the same information. The third passage provides additional information that chicken breast will always come out tender as long as there is enough moisture, and suggests cooking it for 4 hours on high if you're short on time.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question is 6-8 hours on low heat, or 4 hours on high heat if you're short on time.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, it takes 6 - 8 hours to make chicken tender in the crock pot when cooking on low.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, it takes 6 - 8 hours to make chicken tender in the crock pot when cooking on low.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, it takes 6 - 8 hours to make chicken tender in the crock pot when cooking on low.\", \"Step 1: Identify the main topic of the question.\\nThe question is about the time it takes to make chicken tender in a crock pot.\\n\\nStep 2: Search for relevant information in the passages.\\nPassage 1 and Passage 2 both mention cooking chicken on low for 6 - 8 hours or until done.\\nPassage 3 provides additional information about cooking time, mentioning that chicken can be cooked for 4 hours on high if rushed.\\n\\nStep 3: Analyze the information found.\\nBoth passages indicate that the chicken can be cooked for a minimum of 6 hours on low heat to achieve tenderness. However, the passage also suggests that if there is a time constraint, one can cook it on high for 4 hours.\\n\\nStep 4: Formulate the answer based on the analysis.\\nThe answer to the question \\\"How long does it take to make chicken tender in crock pot?\\\" is that it typically takes 6 - 8 hours when cooked on low heat. However, if there is a time constraint, it can be cooked for 4 hours on high heat.\\n\\nAnswer: It takes 6 - 8 hours to make chicken tender in a crock pot when cooked on low heat.\", \"Based on the information provided in the passages, it takes 6 - 8 hours to cook chicken on low for it to become tender in a crock pot. Additionally, if cooking on high, it can be done in 1 hour, then switched to low for about 5 hours. However, it is noted that the chicken will still turn out tender if cooked for 4 hours on high.\", \"The passage does not provide specific information on how long it takes to make chicken tender in a crock pot. It only mentions the cooking time for chicken breasts in a slow cooker, which is 8 hours on low. However, it also notes that it can be cooked for 4 hours on high if time is limited.\\n\\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.\"]", "time_sec": 17.082, "generation_time_seconds": 17.0793, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 432, 4990, 220, 21, 481, 220, 23, 4115, 311, 1281, 16158, 27582, 304, 279, 14093, 377, 3338, 979, 17233, 389, 3347, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.962, -0.0, -0.0, -3.1995, -0.0866, -0.0314, -1.0781, -0.1886, -0.0492, -0.0964, -0.2933, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0623, -0.4287, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0003, -1.5019, -0.0008, 0.0, -0.0007, -0.1491, -0.7123, -0.0073, -0.0007, -0.1039, -0.8181], "cumulative_logprob": -9.7715, "norm_logp": -0.3369, "input_len": 561, "output_tokens": 29, "pred": "Based on the given passages, it takes 6 - 8 hours to make chicken tender in the crock pot when cooking on low."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 1887, 8544, 315, 279, 3405, 624, 785, 3405, 374, 911, 279, 882, 432, 4990, 311, 1281, 16158, 27582, 304, 264, 14093, 