rness fades, leaving a refined flavor that is more delicate than that of cooked spinach. Chard is a beet that has been cultivated for leaf production, resulting in fresh white, yellow, or red leaf stalks. It is also an attractive ornamental plant that adds color to the vegetable garden. Chard is extremely perishable, so it should be kept in the refrigerator for storage, unwashed leaves should be stored in plastic bags in the crisper for 2 to 3 days."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 1376, 1995, 911, 521, 567, 504, 279, 46769, 624, 12, 910, 567, 374, 1083, 3881, 438, 29691, 521, 567, 624, 12, 1084, 702, 3460, 11, 282, 642, 8503, 714, 27582, 5538, 6176, 10901, 323, 12045, 11, 41854, 54872, 82, 624, 12, 910, 567, 374, 4428, 311, 67698, 714, 702, 264, 16245, 11, 803, 2060, 533, 17172, 624, 12, 29160, 3908, 521, 567, 646, 387, 1483, 7112, 304, 76752, 624, 12, 42159, 521, 567, 374, 11136, 29105, 624, 12, 910, 567, 374, 264, 48012, 429, 702, 1012, 11882, 369, 15933, 5670, 624, 12, 910, 567, 646, 387, 66472, 1393, 279, 10901, 525, 3908, 323, 27582, 476, 1283, 47161, 624, 12, 1084, 374, 9016, 82117, 480, 323, 1265, 387, 9768, 304, 12188, 17899, 304, 279, 1560, 27370, 369, 220, 17, 311, 220, 18, 2849, 382, 8304, 220, 17, 25, 29901, 279, 1887, 17452, 315, 521, 567, 438, 264, 35481, 624, 12, 910, 567, 374, 264, 35481, 448, 15933, 88, 50911, 624, 12, 1084, 702, 264, 16245, 11, 803, 2060, 533, 17172, 7707, 311, 67698, 624, 12, 1084, 646, 387, 34561, 7112, 476, 29105, 624, 12, 1084, 374, 264, 943, 315, 48012, 429, 702, 1012, 66066, 369, 15933, 5670, 382, 8304, 220, 18, 25, 3377, 6334, 279, 4226, 3118, 389, 279, 10820, 17452, 624, 1143, 567, 374, 264, 15933, 88, 6176, 35481, 429, 374, 264, 943, 315, 48012, 13, 1084, 702, 3460, 11, 282, 642, 8503, 714, 27582, 5538, 6176, 10901, 323, 12045, 11, 41854, 54872, 82, 13, 910, 567, 374, 4428, 311, 67698, 714, 702, 264, 16245, 11, 803, 2060, 533, 17172, 13, 1084, 646, 387, 34561, 7112, 304, 76752, 476, 29105, 11