{"id": "574", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, it is important to take immediate action as they can quickly infest your home. One effective method is to seal off any entry points that mice can use to enter your house, such as pipes and vents. Placing steel wool inside these openings before sealing them can prevent mice from reentering. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources and shelter can help deter mice from your home.", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This involves sealing off any entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before you seal it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, learn how to eliminate these pests from your home and prevent them from returning.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This involves sealing off any entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before you seal it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, learn how to eliminate these pests from your home and prevent them from returning.", "cot": "[\"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This involves sealing off any entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before you seal it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, learn how to eliminate these pests from your home and prevent them from returning.\", \"Based on the provided passages, here are some methods to quickly get rid of mice:\\n\\n1. **Immediate Action**: The first and most critical step is to take immediate action. This means addressing the problem as soon as you notice it, rather than waiting or hoping it will go away on its own.\\n\\n2. **Sealing Entry Points**: Mice can use small entry points as highways to enter your house. Sealing these entry points can prevent them from entering your home. For example, consider using steel wool inside pipes or vents before sealing them off. This will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.\\n\\n3. **Eliminate Food and Shelter**: Rats and mice will take advantage of any source of food or shelter. By removing any food that has been discarded and ensuring that your home is not a suitable shelter for these pests, you can reduce their population.\\n\\nBy implementing these strategies, you can effectively and quickly get rid of mice in your home.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This is a critical step. Mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting.\", \"To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This is a critical step to getting rid of mice. Mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting. It is recommended to seal off entry points, such as pipes or vents, by using steel wool pads, which will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, learning how to eliminate these pests from your home and preventing them from returning can help in the long term.\"]", "time_sec": 19.948, "generation_time_seconds": 19.9438, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 894, 4343, 3501, 429, 23627, 646, 990, 438, 59295, 311, 633, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 21144, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 498, 25349, 432, 1007, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 1