423, "pred": "To plant a sprouted potato, first prepare the soil by turning it over and breaking it up finely, then dig a trench about 4 inches wide and 6 to 8 inches deep. Cut the sprouted potato into chunks with two or three eyes each, and place them in the trench, with the sprouted side facing up. Cover with a layer of compost and replace the soil, then add a 4-inch layer of mulch around the plants, pulling it back at least 4 inches from the sprouting vines. Water thoroughly and continue watering regularly when the soil is dry to the touch."}, {"rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1249, 6008, 264, 38734, 429, 702, 8151, 18533, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 50590, 279, 75519, 95518, 11999, 279, 17171, 916, 304, 697, 12909, 47014, 3082, 448, 264, 45876, 476, 11956, 261, 311, 264, 7990, 315, 220, 16, 17, 14924, 323, 1438, 279, 25284, 705, 60702, 13, 10783, 894, 3460, 23035, 323, 1008, 33998, 1393, 45876, 287, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 37098, 264, 350, 6655, 95518, 37969, 264, 53252, 911, 220, 19, 14924, 6884, 323, 220, 21, 311, 220, 23, 14924, 5538, 13, 1416, 498, 2299, 2087, 311, 6008, 803, 1091, 825, 2802, 11, 3550, 1105, 10747, 553, 911, 220, 17, 19, 311, 220, 18, 21, 14924, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 50590, 279, 13706, 20187, 95518, 19649, 279, 34167, 1119, 54104, 11, 911, 220, 16, 311, 220, 17, 14924, 389, 1817, 3108, 11, 9380, 264, 8151, 411, 389, 1817, 23739, 13, 1416, 279, 38734, 374, 2613, 11, 498, 646, 6008, 432, 4361, 13, 4710, 19, 13, 3070, 54647, 279, 13706, 20187, 95518, 10771, 279, 54104, 1119, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 53252, 11, 49445, 1817, 23739, 504, 279, 1008, 553, 911, 220, 21, 311, 220, 23, 14924, 13, 10771, 279, 8151, 18533, 476, 7912, 3108, 315, 279, 54104, 12880, 705, 382, 20, 13, 3070, 30896, 323, 29558, 75519, 95518, 17757, 279, 34167, 448, 264, 6193, 315, 56723, 323, 1221, 8290, 279, 25284, 389, 1909, 315, 279, 6008, 819, 382, 1986, 1714, 25351, 429, 279, 38734, 26757, 525, 10277, 34228, 323, 9761, 448, 17171, 11, 22136, 9314, 6513, 13, 151645], "logp_li