r and forcing air out of the lungs."}], "input_len": 389, "output_tokens": 688, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 47.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "679", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea:\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Soothes the senses and relieves stress (Passage 1)\n* Provides relief from pain due to muscle, joint, or ligament injuries (Passage 2)\n* Soothes abdominal pain and aids in digestion (Passage 3)\n\nSide Effects:\n\n* None mentioned in the passages.\n\nNote that there are no side effects mentioned in the passages provided. However, it's important to note that consuming clove tea in large quantities can cause irritation to the stomach and digestive tract, so it's best to consume it in moderation.", "pred": "Drinking clove tea provides several benefits, including soothing the senses, relieving stress, having skin benefits, and aiding in the relief of pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries. It can also soothe abdominal pain, particularly gas pain or other stomach upset. There are no explicit mentions of side effects in the provided passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Step 1: Analyze the provided passages to identify the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea.\nStep 2: From passage 1, we learn that clove tea soothes the senses, relieves stress, and has skin benefits.\nStep 3: From passage 2, we learn that clove tea compresses can relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries.\nStep 4: From passage 3, we learn that clove tea can soothe abdominal pain, particularly gas pain or other stomach upset.\nStep 5: There are no explicit mentions of side effects in the provided passages.\nStep 6: Combine the information from steps 2-5 to formulate the answer.\n\nAnswer: Drinking clove tea provides several benefits, including soothing the senses, relieving stress, having skin benefits, and aiding in the relief of pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries. It can also soothe abdominal pain, particularly gas pain or other stomach upset. There are no explicit mentions of side effects in the provided passages.", "cot": "[\"Step 1: Analyze the provided passages to identify the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea.\\nStep 2: From passage 1, we learn that clove tea soothes the senses, relieves stress, and has skin benefits.\\nStep 3: From passage 2, we learn that clove tea compresses can relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries.\\nStep 4: From passage 3, we learn that clove tea can soothe abdominal pain, particularly gas pain or other stomach upset.\\nStep 5: There are no explicit mentions of side effects in the provided passages.\\nStep 6: Combine the information from steps 2-5 to formulate the answer.\\n\\nAnswer: Drinking clove tea provides several benefits, including soothing the senses, relieving stress, having skin benefits, and aiding in the relief of pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries. It can also soothe abdominal pain, particularly gas pain or other stomach upset. There are no explicit mentions of side effects in the provided passages.\", \"Benefits:\\n- Soothes the senses and relieves stress in the body.\\n- Mix cloves with basil, mint, and cardamom in water to make a flavoured tea.\\n- Provides relief from stress when taken with honey.\\n- Has skin benefits.\\n- Relieves pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries.\\n- Works well for arthritic pain when applied as a tea compress.\\n- Soothes abdominal pain.\\n- Has analgesic qualities that help with gas pain or other stomach upset.\\n- Stimulates blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion.\\n\\nSide Effects:\\n- Not mentioned in the provided passages.\", \"Step 1: Identify the benefits of drinking clove tea from the passage.\\n\\nThe passage states that clove tea soothes the senses and relieves stress. It also mentions that clove tea provides health and skin benefits. Additionally, it has analgesic effects, which can relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries. For oral health, clove tea can soothe abdominal pain and aid in digestion.\\n\\nStep 2: Identify the side effects of drinking clove tea from the passage.\\n\\nThe passage does not explicitly mention any side effects of drinking clove tea. However, it does mention that clove tea compresses should be applied to unbroken skin, suggesting that the tea should not be ingested if it is applied to open wounds.\\n\\nStep 3: Synthesize the information from steps 1 and 2 to provide a comprehensive answer.\\n\\nBased on the provided passage, the benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing health and skin benefits, and having analgesic effects that can relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries. The side effects of drinking clove tea, if any, would be related to the application of clove tea compresses to open wounds, meaning the tea should not be ingested in such cases.\\n\\nAnswer: Benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing health and skin benefits, and having analgesic effects that can relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries. Side effects of drinking clove tea, if any, would be related to the application of clove tea compresses to open wounds, meaning the tea should not be ingested in such cases.\", \"Step 1: Identify benefits of drinking clove tea\\n- Soothes the senses and relieves stress in the body.\\n- Provides relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, cardamom, and honey.\\n- Has skin benefits.\\n- Relieves pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries.\\n- Provides analgesic qualities for stomach upset and digestive issues.\\n- Stimulates blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion.\\n\\nStep 2: Identify side effects of drinking clove tea\\n- Not specified in the provided passages.\\n\\nFinal Answer: Benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing skin benefits, relieving pain from injuries, and aiding in digestion. There are no side effects mentioned in the provided passages.\"]", "time_sec": 38.569, "generation_time_seconds": 38.5623, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0008, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 37427, 2986, 279, 3897, 46769, 311, 10542, 279, 7567, 323, 3108, 6239, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 624, 8304, 220, 17, 25, 5542, 21085, 220, 16, 11, 582, 3960, 429, 5292, 586, 15243, 43176, 6375, 279, 37107, 11, 1351, 38135, 8464, 11, 323, 702, 6787, 7567, 624, 8304, 220, 18, 25, 5542, 21085, 220, 17, 11, 582, 3960, 429, 5292, 586, 15243, 24611, 288, 646, 47739, 6646, 504, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 476, 28313, 2838, 14970, 624, 8304, 220, 19, 25, 5542, 21085, 220, 18, 11, 582, 3960, 429, 5292, 586, 15243, 646, 43176, 1782, 55956, 6646, 11, 7945, 6819, 6646, 476, 1008, 22350, 22459, 624, 8304, 220, 20, 25, 2619, 525, 902, 11464, 33845, 315, 3108, 6239, 304, 279, 3897, 46769, 624, 8304, 220, 21, 25, 46812, 279, 1995, 504, 7354, 220, 17, 12, 20, 311, 88859, 279, 4226, 382, 16141, 25, 82581, 5292, 586, 15243, 5707, 3807, 7567, 11, 2670, 64364, 279, 37107, 11, 58544, 4405, 8464, 11, 3432, 6787, 7567, 11, 323, 85287, 304, 279, 15957, 315, 6646, 504, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 476, 28313, 2838, 14970, 13, 1084, 646, 1083, 43176, 1782, 55956, 6646, 11, 7945, 6819, 6646, 476, 1008, 22350, 22459, 13, 2619, 525, 902, 11464, 33845, 315, 3108, 6239, 304, 279, 3897, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.5538, -0.0003, 0.0, -0.0, -2.2157, -0.0155, -0.0013, -1.9339, -0.0144, -1.016, -0.0322, -0.2139, -0.0037, -0.143, -0.0811, -0.0, -0.0024, -0.0017, -0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.0215, -0.8265, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -1.326, -0.5325, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0037, -0.0239, -0.3724, -0.0056, -0.0179, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0014, 0.0, -0.001, -0.0, -0.1174, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0046, -0.0158, -0.4413, -0.0028, -0.0, -0.0252, -0.0002, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0002, 0.0, -0.0005, -0.0,